      '\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<h1>Motivations</h1>\n' +
      '<h2>Design to Code</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The handover problem from design to code is sourced in using different tools and different paradigms,\n' +
      'with few common language concepts. This leads to a workflow at which the designer designs using\n' +
      'dedicated design tools such as Figma, Photoshop, Axure, does an export to semi-HTML / CSS / Image formats.\n' +
      'The developer then takes those resources and implements the design using Javascript libraries such as\n' +
      'React, Vue, Angular, Svelte. Like any handover, the developer will either implement it a bit of, or during\n' +
      'the implementation some issues will arise, causing the need to perform another round of checks, design and\n' +
      'code fixes, and another round and another... This process tends to become very expensive.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Jay aims to solve that by introducing Jay Code files that design tools can export and update, and developers\n' +
      'can import and use. The idea is to let the <strong>Designer implement the Design</strong> and let the\n' +
      '<strong>Developer implement the logic</strong>.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Exploring the potential formats for a Jay File, there is a single format that is <strong>Forward Compatible</strong> -\n' +
      'will always support any new web standard and evolution of HTML and CSS - and that&#39;s HTML and CSS.</p>\n' +
      '<p>A Jay file at the time of writing this doc looks like the following</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/yaml-jay&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      data:\n' +
      '          items:\n' +
      '              name: string\n' +
      '              completed: boolean\n' +
      '              cost: number\n' +
      '              id: string\n' +
      '          title: string\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{title}<span class="token tag">&lt;/h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
