{
  post: {
    title: 'Jay Element Vs Component',
    content: '<h1>Jay Element vs Jay Component</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Basic Definitions</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>A <strong>Jay Element</strong> is a function of <strong>ViewState</strong> to a certain <strong>DOM</strong> setup. The Jay Element can be represented\n' +
      'as a Jay HTML file or other file formats, and it fully declarative, avoid of logic and safe.\n' +
      'Jay Elements are transformed into safe JS code for a <code>render</code> function, <code>update</code>, <code>mount</code> and <code>unmount</code> functions.</p>\n' +
      '<p>A <strong>Jay Component</strong> is a function of <strong>Props</strong> to a <strong>ViewState</strong>. A Component can handle internal state,\n' +
      'react to Props change, expose an API or events. A <strong>Jay Component</strong> is rendered to <strong>DOM</strong> using a\n' +
      '<strong>Jay Element</strong>.</p>\n' +
      '<p>a <strong>Jay Element</strong> can contain other <strong>Jay Components</strong> or event other <strong>Jay Elements</strong> directly.</p>\n' +
      '<p><img src="/content/design-log/jay/02-jay-element-vs-component.png" alt="Overview" loading="lazy" title="Jay Element vs Component" /></p>\n' +
      '<p>The Jay system consists of two main entities - the <strong>Jay Component</strong> and the <strong>Jay Element</strong>.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Jay Element</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The <strong>Jay Element</strong> is a pure declarative design, including data and states that is represented as an HTML + CSS files.\n' +
      'The <strong>Jay File</strong> consists of, in addition to HTML and CSS, an addition of special Jay tags and a data script\n' +
      'that represent the inputs of the JayElement.</p>\n' +
      '<p>An example Jay Element looks like (non final syntax)</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/yaml-jay&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      data:\n' +
      '        count: number\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;subtracter&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>-<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">style</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;margin: 0 16px&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{count}<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;adder&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>+<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>It is compiled into a declaration file (<code>.d.ts</code>) and a runtime file</p>\n' +
      '<p>The definition file:</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> JayElement <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface ViewState <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  count<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterElement <span class="token keyword">extends</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  subtracter<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  adder<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">render</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token operator">:</span> ViewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> CounterElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The runtime file:</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> JayElement<span class="token punctuation">,</span> element as e<span class="token punctuation">,</span> dynamicText as dt<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ConstructContext <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      'interface ViewState <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  count<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterElement <span class="token keyword">extends</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  subtracter<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  adder<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">render</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token operator">:</span> ViewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> CounterElement <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> ConstructContext<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withRootContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span>\n' +
      `    <span class="token function">e</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'div'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>\n` +
      `      <span class="token function">e</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'button'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> ref<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'subtracter'</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">'-'</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      `      <span class="token function">e</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'span'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> style<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> cssText<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'margin: 0 16px'</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token function">dt</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> vs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      `      <span class="token function">e</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'button'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> ref<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'adder'</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">'+'</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">)</span> as CounterElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Jay Component</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The <strong>Ja'... 11502 more characters,
