{
  post: {
    title: 'Compiler',
    content: '<h1>The Jay Compiler</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>The Jay Compiler transforms a Jay File into different outputs -</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Runtime File</li>\n' +
      '<li>Typescript definition File</li>\n' +
      '<li>[todo] test driver file</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>The compiler API</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The compiler API is very simple at this stage</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> declare type JayValidations <span class="token operator">=</span> Array<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>string<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> declare <span class="token keyword">class</span> WithValidations<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>T<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  val<span class="token operator">?:</span> T<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  validations<span class="token operator">:</span> JayValidations<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">constructor</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>val<span class="token operator">:</span> T <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token keyword">undefined</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> validations<span class="token operator">:</span> JayValidations<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  map<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>R<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>func<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>T<span class="token operator">:</span> any<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> R<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> WithValidations<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>R<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  flatMap<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>R<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>func<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>T<span class="token operator">:</span> any<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> WithValidations<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>R<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> WithValidations<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>R<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">generateDefinitionFile</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>html<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> WithValidations<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>string<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">generateRuntimeFile</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>html<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> WithValidations<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>string<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>The compiler inner working</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The compiler works in a few stages</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>parsing a Jay file using an HTML parser</li>\n' +
      '<li>parsing the data part as yaml</li>\n' +
      '<li>parse expressions using PEG.js custom parser</li>\n' +
      '<li>generate runtime file</li>\n' +
      '<li>generate typescript definition file</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Log Methodology Note</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> These design logs are written primarily for AI agents as part of the <a href="/design-log">Design Log methodology</a> and made accessible here for human readers. The language and structure are optimized for machine consumption — expect precise, specification-style prose rather than narrative documentation.</p>\n',
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Compiler","number":4}'
  }
}
