{
  post: {
    title: 'Events',
    content: '<h1>Working on Events in Jay Files</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>The challenge with events are that events are streaming information from the JayComponent back to the code using the\n' +
      'JayComponent defined in a JayFile.</p>\n' +
      '<p>For events, we have two key requirements</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>expose a programming model that is efficient for the developer</li>\n' +
      '<li>expose an event model (in the JayFile) that a designer can work with</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>There are a lot of web frameworks, and a lot of ways web frameworks represent event binding to the HTML / template /\n' +
      'JSX. A good reference is <a href="https://webcomponents.dev/blog/all-the-ways-to-make-a-web-component/">this blog post</a></p>\n' +
      '<p>React / JSX event binding</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-jsx"><span class="token operator">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">setState</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span>count<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>state<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">-</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token operator">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Angular</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-angular2html">\n' +
      '&lt;button (click)=&quot;dec()&quot;&gt;-&lt;/button&gt;</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Stencil</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-jsx"><span class="token operator">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">bind</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token operator">&gt;-&lt;/</span>button<span class="token operator">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Svelte</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> on:<span class="token attribute">click</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;{dec}&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Native web component</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>shadowRoot<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getElementById</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'inc'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">inc</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n` +
      '<p>SlimJS</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">click</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;dec&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>-<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Lume Elements</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-jsx"><span class="token operator">&lt;</span>button onclick<span class="token operator">=</span>$<span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">-=</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token operator">&gt;-&lt;/</span>button<span class="token operator">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>We learn from those examples that developers prefer binding event to a function or to an inline function. However, those\n' +
      'binding patterns have two challenges for Jay.</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>JayFiles should be logic free, not allowing inline event handlers</li>\n' +
      '<li>Designers writing JayFiles, or generating JayFiles, may not be able to bind the right event name to the right code\n' +
      'function</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h1>Events binding in Jay</h1>\n' +
      '<p>With Jay, we try to decouple the JayFile from the code element. We explore two main directions for event bindings below.\n' +
      'More options can be found in the <a href="../exploration">exploration</a> folder</p>\n' +
      '<h2>1 - id based event binding</h2>\n' +
      '<p>with this option we add an <code>id</code> property to the JayFile, which we are using for both event binding and for test driver\n' +
      'generation</p>\n' +
      '<p>the JayFile</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/yaml-jay&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      data:\n' +
      '         count: number\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">id</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;dec&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>-<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">id</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;count&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{count}<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">id</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;inc&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>+<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The Code file extending it - one option</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> JayElement <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> render<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ViewState <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./counter.jay'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">Counter</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>initial<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> count <span class="token operator">=</span> initial<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> element <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">render</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> count <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">inc</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    count <span class="token operator">+=</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    element<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">update</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> count <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="t'... 52662 more characters,
