{
  post: {
    title: 'State Management',
    content: '<h1>Working on state management</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>First, lets define the problem we are trying to solve with state management. Let&#39;s consider a simple component to\n' +
      'demonstrate the problem - a counter component with the options of initial value and step.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Our component also shows a specific message when the count is zero. The component Jay element is then</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/yaml-jay&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      data:\n' +
      '        count: number\n' +
      '        isZero: boolean\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;subtracter&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>-<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">style</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;margin: 0 16px&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{count}<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">if</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;{isZero}&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>absolute zero<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;adder&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>+<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>A simple counter component is then</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> render <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./counter.jay.html'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">Counter</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>initialValue<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">,</span> step<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> data <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    count<span class="token operator">:</span> initialValue<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    isZero<span class="token operator">:</span> initialValue <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> jayElement <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">render</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>data<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  jayElement<span class="token punctuation">.</span>adder<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">+=</span> step<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>isZero <span class="token operator">=</span> data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    jayElement<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">update</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>data<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  jayElement<span class="token punctuation">.</span>subtracter<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">-=</span> step<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>isZero <span class="token operator">=</span> data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    jayElement<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">update</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>data<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    element<span class="token operator">:</span> jayElement<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    update<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>newValue<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">,</span> newStep<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '      step <span class="token operator">=</span> newStep<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '      data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">=</span> newValue<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '      data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>isZero <span class="token operator">=</span> data<span class="token punctuation">.</span>count <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '      jayElement<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">update</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>data<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>We note that there are a number of patterns with this component</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>We have to call <code>jayElement.update({count})</code> on each event handler and the component update. This is both a code\n' +
      'duplicate and boilerplate</li>\n' +
      '<li>We have a computation of <code>isZero</code> in three places. This is again code duplication.</li>\n' +
      '<li>We have different type of data entities</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>initialValue</code> and <code>step</code> are properties</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>count</code> is a state</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>isZeo</code> is a computed step</li>\n' +
      '<li>both <code>count</code> and <code>isZero</code> are the view state of the element</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>Can we create something better?</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Data Flow</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The data flow can take three main routes</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><code>Properties -&gt; State -&gt; Computed State -&gt; view state</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>Event -&gt; state -&gt; Computed State -&gt; view state</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>API call -&gt; state -&gt; Computed State -&gt; view state</code></li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>First attempt - component builder call</h2>\n' +
      '<p>It is clear that we have a uniform data path of <code>state -&gt; Computed State -&gt; view state</code>. We can use this property to\n' +
      'create a <code>setState</code> API to trigger the data flow, and a <code>computeState</code> function for the computed state. With this in\n' +
      'mind, we can create a state manager with a signature of\n' +
      '<code>new StateManager&lt;T, S, A extends JayElement&lt;T&gt;&gt;(initialState: S, computeViewState: S =&gt; T, render: T =&gt; A)</code></p>\n' +
      '<p>making the component look like</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> render <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./counter.jay.html'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> StateManager <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-state'</span><span class="t`... 125962 more characters,
