    title: 'Nested Components',
    content: '<h1>Working on nested components</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>adding nested components to Jay seems simple. A Component is built using a Jay Element and can easily be made to conform\n' +
      'to the Jay Element interface.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Nesting a component into a Jay Element creates the relationship of</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">Jay Element -&gt; Jay Component -&gt; Jay Element -&gt; Jay Component -&gt; Jay Element</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>We define a Jay Element initially as</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">interface JayComponent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>Props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> jayElement <span class="token keyword">extends</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  element<span class="token operator">:</span> jayElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  update<span class="token operator">:</span> updateFunc<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>Props<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  mount<span class="token operator">:</span> mountFunc<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  unmount<span class="token operator">:</span> mountFunc<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>While the JayComponent is very similar to a JayElement, they are still different in some aspects. The <code>childComp</code>\n' +
      'constructor adjusts a JayComponent to the JayElement interface, allowing a JayComponent to be a direct child of\n' +
      'JayElement</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> childComp<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>\n' +
      '  ParentT<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  Props<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  ChildT<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  ChildElement <span class="token keyword">extends</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ChildT<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  ChildComp <span class="token keyword">extends</span> JayComponent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>Props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ChildT<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ChildElement<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>compCreator<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token operator">:</span> Props<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> ChildComp<span class="token punctuation">,</span> getProps<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>t<span class="token operator">:</span> ParentT<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> Props<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ParentT<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>and the usage within a compiled Jay File is those</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token function">e</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'div'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token function">childComp</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token operator">:</span> ItemData<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">Item</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      `    <span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> text<span class="token operator">:</span> vs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>staticItem<span class="token punctuation">,</span> dataId<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'AAA'</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h1>References and Events</h1>\n' +
      '<p>When we have nested components, in most cases the parent component will also require a reference to the nested\n' +
      'component, and the ability to add event handlers to the component.</p>\n' +
      '<p>There are a number of methods of adding such events - namely</p>\n' +
      '<h2>1. Callback Functions</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Using callback functions as part of the component Props. The downside of this option is that for each update, we create\n' +
      'new closures and that is it very verbose.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Assuming we have an Item component, it will look like</p>\n' +
      '<p><code>item.jay.html</code></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
