{
  post: {
    title: 'Safe Events',
    content: '<h1>Safe Events - an idea</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>When running application login in a worker that interacts with the DOM, we normally stumble on challenges\n' +
      'caused by having an async API between the worker and the main thread. Things like opening a new window on\n' +
      'event do not work, or preventing an event default, or starting a video\n' +
      'playing.</p>\n' +
      '<p>The following code will not work from a worker - <code>event.preventDefault()</code> is a synchronous API\n' +
      'and if the below code is working from a worker cannot take effect.</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> JayElement <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> makeJayComponent<span class="token punctuation">,</span> Props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> createState <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-component'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> render<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> CounterElement <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./counter.jay'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterProps <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  initial<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
