  post: {
    title: 'Building Components - A Challenge',
    content: '<h1>A challenge at building the Jay Component API</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>The challenge is a classic who comes first?</p>\n' +
      '<p>We have a Jay Element who is a function of <code>ViewState =&gt; JayElement</code>\n' +
      'and a Jay Component who is a function of <code>(props, JayElement) =&gt; ViewState</code></p>\n' +
      '<p>However, in order to create a <code>JayElement</code> we need the <code>ViewState</code>, and\n' +
      'in order to build the <code>ViewStatae</code> we need the <code>JayElement</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Actually, when looking at the component code, the dependency is not exactly\n' +
      'as the above. The actual component code is, for example -</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> render<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ViewState <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./counter.jay.html'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> createEffect<span class="token punctuation">,</span> createState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> createEvents<span class="token punctuation">,</span> makeJayComponent <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-hooks'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      'interface CoutnerProps <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  initialValue<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  step<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">counter</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token operator">:</span> Props<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>CoutnerProps<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> je<span class="token operator">:</span> CounterElement<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> ViewState <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>count<span class="token punctuation">,</span> setCount<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createState</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">initialValue</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  je<span class="token punctuation">.</span>adder<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">setCount</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">count</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>step<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  je<span class="token punctuation">.</span>subtracter<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">setCount</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>val<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> val <span class="token operator">-</span> props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>step<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> isZero <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createMemo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">count</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">return </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> count<span class="token punctuation">,</span> isZero <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">default</span> <span class="token function">makeJayComponent</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>render<span class="token punctuation">,</span> counter<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>When we examine the above code, it is clear that the component returns the\n' +
      '<code>ViewState</code> which is in turn computed from the props and state. The component depends on the\n' +
      '<code>JayElement</code> in order to register events.</p>\n' +
      '<p>However, the two things are not really related - we could have created the component as two different\n' +
      'functions - one to register events, and one to compute the <code>ViewState</code>. The two things are bound into a single<br>function because it creates a simpler and more concise coding model.</p>\n' +
      '<p>To solve the problem, we can, instead of breaking the function into two functions, to break the <code>JayElement</code> type\n' +
      'into two types - the actual element, and the element events.</p>\n' +
      '<p>We change <code>JayElement</code> from</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// Jay runtime</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  dom<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  update<span class="token operator">:</span> updateFunc<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  mount<span class="token operator">:</span> mountFunc<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  unmount<span class="token operator">:</span> mountFunc<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// generated by compiler</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterElement <span class="token keyword">extends</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  subtracter<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  adder<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>into</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// Jay runtime</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> Refs<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  dom<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  update<span class="token operator">:</span> updateFunc<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  mount<span class="token operator">:</span> mountFunc<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  unmount<span class="token operator">:</span> mountFunc<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// generated by compiler</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterRefs <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  subtracter<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  adder<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElement<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterElement <span class="token keyword">extends</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> CounterRefs<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> CounterRefs <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>which now enables the component to receive the <code>CounterRefs</code> such that</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> render<span class="token punctuation">,</span> ViewState <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./counter.jay.html'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '<span class="token keyword">import<'... 5165 more characters,
