{
  post: {
    title: 'Hydration Test Plan',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #104 — Hydration Test Plan</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Dev server tests now support running generated client scripts in JSDOM (see <code>run-script-in-jsdom.ts</code>). This test plan defines coverage for hydration across template constructs and headless component placement.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Related Design Logs</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>#93 — Client hydration (coordinate system, element bridge)</li>\n' +
      '<li>#99 — Hydration coordinate alignment bugs</li>\n' +
      '<li>#100 — Hydrate conditional creation fallback</li>\n' +
      '<li>#102 — Headless instance SSR and hydration compilation</li>\n' +
      '<li>#84 — Headless component props and repeater support</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Test Plan Overview</h2>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Category</th>\n' +
      '<th>Scope</th>\n' +
      '<th>Validation</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td>1. Static elements</td>\n' +
      '<td>Plain HTML, no dynamic content</td>\n' +
      '<td>Rendering</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>2. Conditionals</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>{if}</code> / <code>{else}</code> branches</td>\n' +
      '<td>Rendering, interactivity</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>3. forEach</td>\n' +
      '<td>Client-side iteration</td>\n' +
      '<td>Rendering, interactivity</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>4. slowForEach</td>\n' +
      '<td>Server-rendered iteration</td>\n' +
      '<td>Rendering, interactivity</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>5. Headless components</td>\n' +
      '<td>slow, fast, interactive phases</td>\n' +
      '<td>Rendering, interactivity</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>6. Validation</td>\n' +
      '<td>All cases</td>\n' +
      '<td>Rendering + interactivity</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>1. Static Elements</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Goal:</strong> Verify static HTML hydrates without errors and remains intact.</p>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Test</th>\n' +
      '<th>Setup</th>\n' +
      '<th>Assert</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td>1.1</td>\n' +
      '<td>Page with only static text and markup</td>\n' +
      '<td>DOM matches SSR HTML; no hydration errors</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>1.2</td>\n' +
      '<td>Static elements with refs (no bindings)</td>\n' +
      '<td>Refs resolve to correct DOM nodes</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>1.3</td>\n' +
      '<td>Nested static structure</td>\n' +
      '<td>Full tree preserved; coordinates correct</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Fixtures:</strong> <code>page-static-only</code>, <code>page-static-with-refs</code></p>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>2. Conditionals</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Goal:</strong> Verify conditional branches hydrate and update correctly.</p>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
