      '<p><strong>Fixtures:</strong> <code>page-slow-foreach</code>, <code>page-slow-foreach-empty</code></p>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>5. Headless Components</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Goal:</strong> Verify headless instances hydrate in all placements and phases.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>5a. Static placement</h3>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
