      '<td>Interactive updates in slowForEach headless</td>\n' +
      '<td>Updates work; carryForward lookup works</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Fixtures:</strong> <code>page-headless-static-*</code>, <code>page-headless-conditional</code>, <code>page-headless-foreach</code>, <code>page-headless-slow-foreach</code>, <code>page-headless-mixed</code></p>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>6. Validation</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>6e. Validate rendering</h3>\n' +
      '<p>For each test case above:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> SSR HTML contains expected structure</li>\n' +
      '<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Hydration completes without errors</li>\n' +
