{
  post: {
    title: 'Headless Component Default Fast View State',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #105 — Headless Component Client Defaults</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Headless component instances inside <code>forEach</code> can be added dynamically on the client (e.g., &quot;Add Item&quot; button appends to the array). When a new item is created client-side, <code>makeHeadlessInstanceComponent</code>&#39;s <code>wrappedConstructor</code> looks up the instance&#39;s fast ViewState from <code>__headlessInstances[key]</code> — but no server data exists for the new item. The lookup returns <code>undefined</code>, <code>makeSignals({})</code> creates an empty object, and the interactive constructor crashes when destructuring signals (e.g., <code>const [value, setValue] = fastViewState.value</code> → TypeError).</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Related</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>DL#102 Issue 7 — headless instance ref onclick (fixed: coordinate on root element)</li>\n' +
      '<li>DL#104 — hydration test plan (6c forEach interactivity test exposes this)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>When a headless component instance is created <strong>client-side</strong> (not from SSR):</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>No <code>__headlessInstances</code> entry exists for the new instance&#39;s coordinate key</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>fastVS</code> is <code>undefined</code> → <code>makeSignals({})</code> → empty signals</li>\n' +
      '<li>Interactive constructor receives empty <code>Signals&lt;FastVS&gt;</code> → crash on destructure</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>This affects:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>forEach &quot;add item&quot; — new items have no server data</li>\n' +
      '<li>Conditional toggle — showing a previously-hidden headless instance that wasn&#39;t SSR&#39;d (condition was false at SSR time)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Any dynamic headless instance creation after initial page load</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>Does NOT affect:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Conditional true→false→true toggle — the DOM instance and component are preserved, no new creation needed</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>New lifecycle: <code>withClientDefaults</code></h3>\n' +
      '<p>Add an optional lifecycle function to the full-stack component builder that provides default ViewState and carryForward values from props. Called on the <strong>client only</strong> when server data is missing.</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> widget <span class="token operator">=</span> makeJayStackComponent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>WidgetContract<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span>withProps<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>WidgetProps<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withFastRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">async </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">// Server-side: may use database, services, etc.</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> product <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">await</span> db<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getProduct</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>productId<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">return</span> Pipeline<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">ok</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">toPhaseOutput</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '      viewState<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> name<span class="token operator">:</span> product<span class="token punctuation">.</span>name<span class="token punctuation">,</span> price<span class="token operator">:</span> product<span class="token punctuation">.</span>price<span class="token punctuation">,</span> inStock<span class="token operator">:</span> product<span class="token punctuation">.</span>inStock <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '      carryForward<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> productId<span class="token operator">:</span> product<span class="token punctuation">.</span>id <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withClientDefaults</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">// Client-side fallback: pure computation from props, no server APIs</span>\n' +
      '    viewState<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> name<span class="token operator">:</span> props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>name<span class="token punctuation">,</span> price<span class="token operator">:</span> props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>price<span class="token punctuation">,</span> inStock<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token keyword">true</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    carryForward<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> productId<span class="token operator">:</span> props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>productId <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withInteractive</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> refs<span class="token punctuation">,</span> fastViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> carryForward<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">// fastViewState is ALWAYS Signals&lt;FastVS&gt; — never undefined</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>inStock<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> fastViewState<span class="token punctuation">.</span>inStock<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">// ...</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Note: The props are the same on server and client. On the server, the page&#39;s fast render does the query and passes product data as props to each widget. On the client, the page passes the same props when adding new items. <code>clientDefaults</code> uses these props to compute initial values.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Synchronous only</h3>\n' +
      '<p><code>clientDefaults</code> is synchronous — <code>(props: Props) =&gt; { viewState, carryForward }</code>. No <code>Promise</code> support.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Individual ViewState members can be async (Jay supports async rendering via <code>when-loading</code>/<code>when-resolved</code>). If the component needs to fetch data for a new item, it should use an async ViewState member, not an async <code>clientDefaults</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Runtime behavior</h3>\n' +
      '<p>In <code>makeHeadlessInstanceComponent</code>&#39;s <code>wrappedConstructor</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> fastVS <span class="token operator">=</span> instanceData<span class="token operator">?</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>viewStates<span class="token operator">?</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span>resolvedKey<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> cf <span class="token operator">=</span> instanceData<span class="token operator">?</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>carryForwards<span class="token operator">?</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span>resolvedKey<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">let</span> resolvedFastVS<span class="token operator">:</span> object<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">let</span> resolvedCf<span class="token operator">:</span> object<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>fastVS<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">// Server data available (exis'... 14868 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Headless Component Default Fast View State","number":105}'
  }
}
