{
  post: {
    title: 'Hydrate Dynamic Element With Kindergarten',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #106 — Hydrate Dynamic Elements with Kindergarten</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The element target&#39;s <code>e()</code> function uses <code>Kindergarten</code> to manage mixed children — static elements, forEach groups, and conditional groups each get their own <code>KindergartenGroup</code>. The <code>getOffsetFor(group)</code> method sums the sizes of preceding groups to compute the correct DOM insertion index. This ensures that adding a forEach item inserts at the right position among siblings.</p>\n' +
      '<p>The hydrate target&#39;s <code>adoptElement</code> does NOT use Kindergarten. It collects child updates/mounts but treats all children as a flat list. When <code>hydrateForEach</code> creates a <code>Kindergarten</code>, it creates it directly on the <strong>container element</strong> (the forEach wrapper <code>&lt;div class=&quot;list&quot;&gt;</code>), not on the parent that holds mixed content.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Related</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>DL#102 Issue 8 (new) — forEach add item inserts at wrong position</li>\n' +
      '<li>DL#104 — hydration test plan (6c forEach interactivity)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Page structure:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">jay-coordinate</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;0&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- parent with mixed content --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>ForEach Headless<span class="token tag">&lt;/h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- static child (group 0) --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;list&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>...<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- forEach item 1 (group 1) --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;list&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>...<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- forEach item 2 (group 1) --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;list&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>...<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- forEach item 3 (group 1) --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Add Item<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- static child (group 2) --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Remove Last<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- static child (group 3) --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Current hydrate code:</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token function">adoptElement</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>\n` +
      `  <span class="token function">adoptText</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0/0'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> vs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>title<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      `  <span class="token function">hydrateForEach</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> vs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>items<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'_id'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> adoptItem<span class="token punctuation">,</span> createItem<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      `  <span class="token function">adoptElement</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0/2'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token function">refAddButton</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      `  <span class="token function">adoptElement</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0/3'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token function">refRemoveButton</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      '<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><code>hydrateForEach</code> creates a <code>Kindergarten</code> on the container element (<code>&lt;div jay-coordinate=&quot;0&quot;&gt;</code>), but with <code>newGroup()</code> at index 0. It doesn&#39;t account for the <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> before it. When a new item is added, <code>getOffsetFor(group)</code> returns 0 (no preceding groups), so the item is inserted before the <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> instead of after the existing forEach items.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Similarly, <code>hydrateConditional</code> inserts an anchor comment and uses <code>insertBefore</code> relative to the adopted element&#39;s sibling. If other children are added/removed around it, the anchor position may become incorrect.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Unified approach: <code>adoptDynamicElement</code> with Kindergarten</h3>\n' +
      '<p>When the compiler detects that an element&#39;s children include <code>hydrateForEach</code> or <code>hydrateConditional</code>, it emits <code>adoptDynamicElement</code> instead of <code>adoptElement</code>. This function creates a <code>Kindergarten</code> on the DOM element and assigns each child position to a <code>KindergartenGroup</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Only elements with dynamic children use this. Static-only <code>adoptElement</code> calls remain unchanged (no Kindergarten overhead).</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Accounting for static holes</h3>\n' +
      '<p>The SSR DOM may contain static children that have no corresponding hydrate code. For example:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">jay-coordinate</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;0&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Title<span class="token tag">&lt;/h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- static, no hydrate code --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;p</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Description<span class="token tag">&lt;/p</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- static, no hydrate code --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;list&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>...<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- forEach item 1 --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;list&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>...<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- forEach item 2 --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">jay-coordinate</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;0/4&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>count<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- dynamic text --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">jay-coordinate</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;0/5&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Add<span '... 39299 more characters,
