{
  post: {
    title: 'Unified Dev Server Phase Pipeline',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #109 — Unified Dev Server Phase Pipeline</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The dev server has three request handlers (<code>handleClientOnlyRequest</code>, <code>handlePreRenderRequest</code>, <code>handleCachedRequest</code>) that each implement headless instance handling as separate steps scattered across the handler code. Each handler calls <code>discoverHeadlessInstances</code>, <code>slowRenderInstances</code>, <code>renderFastChangingDataForInstances</code>, and <code>renderFastChangingDataForForEachInstances</code> independently with different gating logic. This causes:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Test 7a</strong> (fast-only page + headless): <code>slowRenderInstances</code> skips instances without <code>withSlowlyRender</code> (line 75: <code>if (!comp.compDefinition.slowlyRender) continue</code>). Returns <code>undefined</code> when no instances have slow data. This blocks the fast phase gate → widget data never reaches <code>__headlessInstances</code>.</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Test 7b</strong> (interactive-only page): SSR renders &quot;undefined&quot; for all values. After hydration, the interactive constructor provides values but <code>hydrateCompositeJayComponent</code> doesn&#39;t trigger an initial update → adopted DOM stays &quot;undefined&quot;.</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>DL#107 identified this as &quot;Phase 5 pre-processing extraction.&quot;</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Instance handling is fragmented across handlers</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Each handler duplicates ~50 lines of instance handling: discovery → slow render → fast render → merge into <code>__headlessInstances</code>. The logic differs subtly between handlers (e.g., <code>handleClientOnlyRequest</code> skips validation, cached handler reads from cache, pre-render handler writes to cache).</p>\n' +
      '<h3><code>slowRenderInstances</code> skips fast-only instances</h3>\n' +
      '<p><code>instance-slow-render.ts:75</code> — <code>if (!comp || !comp.compDefinition.slowlyRender) continue;</code> — fast-only instances are never added to <code>discoveredForFast</code>, so their <code>fastRender</code> is never called.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Interactive-only pages lack initial hydration update</h3>\n' +
      '<p><code>hydrateCompositeJayComponent</code> adopts SSR DOM and constructs interactive parts, but never calls <code>update()</code> with the constructor&#39;s initial render output.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Absorb instance handling into the existing runners</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Instead of running instance discovery and rendering as separate steps in each handler, absorb them into <code>loadPageParts</code>, <code>runSlowlyForPage</code>, and <code>renderFastChangingData</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Change 1: <code>loadPageParts</code> — add instance discovery</h3>\n' +
      '<p><code>loadPageParts</code> already reads the jay-html and processes headless imports. It knows the <code>headlessInstanceComponents</code>. Add discovery here.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Current:</strong> Returns <code>headlessInstanceComponents</code> (component definitions) and <code>headlessContracts</code> (key-based contracts). Discovery happens later in each handler.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>New:</strong> Also runs <code>discoverHeadlessInstances()</code> on the jay-html content and returns <code>discoveredInstances</code> and <code>forEachInstances</code> alongside the existing data.</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// Add to LoadPagePartsResult:</span>\n' +
      'discoveredInstances<span class="token operator">:</span> DiscoveredHeadlessInstance<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'forEachInstances<span class="token operator">:</span> ForEachHeadlessInstance<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> For the pre-render path, discovery must run on the pre-rendered HTML (after <code>slowRenderTransform</code>). So the pre-render handler calls <code>loadPageParts</code> twice: once with original jay-html (to get component definitions), then after slow render with the pre-rendered jay-html (to get discovery results). The second call can pass the pre-rendered content to <code>loadPageParts</code> via the existing <code>preRenderedPath</code> option, which re-parses and re-discovers.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>packages/jay-stack/stack-server-runtime/lib/load-page-parts.ts</code></p>\n' +
      '<h3>Change 2: <code>runSlowlyForPage</code> — absorb instance slow render</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Current:</strong> Only runs <code>slowlyRender</code> for key-based parts. Returns <code>phaseOutput(slowViewState, carryForward)</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>New:</strong> Also runs <code>slowlyRender</code> for discovered instances (from Change 1). Returns a uniform result that always includes <code>instancePhaseData</code> (even if empty).</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// Extended return type:</span>\n' +
      'interface SlowPhaseResult <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  rendered<span class="token operator">:</span> object<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// page slow ViewState</span>\n' +
      '  carryForward<span class="token operator">:</span> object<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// page carryForward</span>\n' +
      '  instancePhaseData<span class="token operator">:</span> InstancePhaseData<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// always present</span>\n' +
      '  instanceSlowViewStates<span class="token operator">:</span> Record<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>string<span class="token punctuation">,</span> object<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// for resolveHeadlessInstances</span>\n' +
      '  instanceResolvedData<span class="token operator">:</span> Array<span class="token operator">&lt;</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">;</span> contract<span class="token punctuation">;</span> slowViewState <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// for resolveHeadlessInstances</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The key change: instances WITHOUT <code>slowlyRender</code> are still added to <code>instancePhaseData.discovered</code> — they just have empty carryForward. This ensures the fast phase always sees them.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>packages/jay-stack/stack-server-runtime/lib/slowly-changing-runner.ts</code></p>\n' +
      '<h3>Change 3: <code>renderFastChangingData</code> — absorb instance fast render</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Current:</strong> Only runs <code>fastRender</code> for key-based parts. Instance fast render is done by separate functions (<code>renderFastChangingDataForInstances</code>, <code>renderFastChangingDataForForEachInstances</code>) called from each handler.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>New:</strong> Also runs fast render for instances. Receives <code>instancePhaseData</code> and <code>headlessInstanceComponents</code> as parameters. Returns <code>__headlessInstances</code> merged into the fast ViewState.</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// Extended signature:</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">renderFastChangingData</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  pageParams<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  pageProps<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  carryForward<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  parts<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">// New parameters:</span>\n' +
      '  instancePhaseData<span class="token operator">?:</span> InstancePhaseData<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  headlessInstanceComponents<span class="token operator">?:</span> HeadlessInstanceComponent<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  mergedSlowFastViewState<span class="token operator">?:</span> object<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token comment">// needed for forEach instance array resolution</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> Promise<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>AnyFastRenderResult<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// returned viewState includes __headlessInstances</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Handles both static instances and forEach instances. For instances without <code>slowlyRender</code>, calls <code>fastRender(props, ...services)</code>. For instances with <code>slowlyRender</code>, calls <code>fastRender(props, carryForward, ...services)</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>packages/jay-stack/stack-server-runtime/lib/fast-changing-runner.ts</code></p>\n' +
      '<h3>Change 4: Simplify request handlers</h3>\n' +
      '<p>With Changes 1-3, each handler becomes:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">loadPageParts() → parts + discoveredInstances + forEachInstances\n' +
      'runSlowlyForPage(parts, discoveredInstances) → slowVS + instancePhaseData\n' +
      '[pre-render only: slowRenderTransform + resolveHeadlessInstances]\n' +
      'renderFastChangingData(parts, instancePhaseData, ...) → fastVS with __headlessInstances\n' +
      'sendResponse()</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Remove: <code>renderFastChangingDataForInstances</code>, <code>renderFastChangingDataForForEachInstances</code> from <code>dev-server.ts</code> (they move into <code>renderFastChangingData</code>). Remove instance handling boilerplate from all three handlers.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>packages/jay-stack/dev-server/lib/dev-server.ts</code></p>\n' +
      '<h3>Change 5: Fix interactive-only hydration (7b)</h3>\n' +
      '<'... 15764 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Unified Dev Server Phase Pipeline","number":109}'
  }
}
