{
  post: {
    title: 'Server Side Rendering',
    content: '<h1>Server Site Rendering</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Requirements</h2>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>render the elements to <code>stream</code> or <code>string</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Support async rendering in the server</li>\n' +
      '<li>No state management on server</li>\n' +
      '<li>Expose web methods to the client</li>\n' +
      '<li>Enable client only components or server only components</li>\n' +
      '<li>Enable lazy loading of client code - on event or on idle</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Build Components</h2>\n' +
      '<p>If we consider the <code>Jay Element</code> as a build time function of the structure <code>() =&gt; Definition&lt;ViewState -&gt; UI&gt;</code> we can\n' +
      'define build time components that are functions of <code>(Definition&lt;ViewState -&gt; UI&gt;) =&gt; Definition&lt;ViewState -&gt; UI&gt;</code> that\n' +
      'enable to set values into UI at build time, letting server and client components to continue working from that\n' +
      'point forward.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>observation</h2>\n' +
      '<p>In Jay, the <strong>Element</strong> is a function <code>ViewState -&gt; UI</code></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Build Element</strong> - is the Jay file definition which is formally <code>() =&gt; Definition&lt;ViewState -&gt; UI&gt;</code>.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Client Element</strong> - On the <strong>client</strong> it translates to\n' +
      '<code>ViewState -&gt; {dom: Element, update: (ViewState) -&gt; void}</code>, the update function to enable updating the DOM.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Server Element</strong> - On the <strong>server</strong> it should translate to\n' +
      '<code>ViewState -&gt; {htmlFragment: string | stream}</code>.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>The <strong>Component</strong> is a function <code>Props -&gt; ViewState</code></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Client Component</strong> - On the <strong>client</strong> it translates to\n' +
      '<code>Props -&gt; {update: () -&gt; ViewState}</code>, the update function used to update the UI.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Server Component</strong> - On the <strong>server</strong> it translates to\n' +
      '<code>Props -&gt; Promise&lt;ViewState&gt;</code></p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Build Component</strong> - at build time, a higher level function over the element definition\n' +
      '<code>(Definition&lt;ViewState -&gt; UI&gt;) =&gt; Definition&lt;ViewState -&gt; UI&gt;</code></p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>We can have <strong>Pure Client</strong> components at which the component renders initially (on the server or client) using\n' +
      'a null View State, then updates once the client component kicks in.</p>\n' +
      '<p>We can have <strong>Pure Server</strong> components at which the client component is the Unit Function\n' +
      '<code>(server rendered View State) -&gt; View State</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<p>We can have <strong>Lazy loaded</strong> components at which the <strong>Server Component</strong> renders the component, and the\n' +
      '<strong>Client Component</strong> is only loaded on first interaction.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Example</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Let&#39;s consider the Counter Component - the component is now split into 3 files</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Counter Element</li>\n' +
      '<li>Counter Client Component</li>\n' +
      '<li>Counter Server Component</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Counter Element</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/yaml-jay&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      data:\n' +
      '        count: number\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;subtracter&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>-<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">style</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;margin: 0 16px&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{count}<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;adder&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>+<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Counter Client Component</h3>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Note: no need to get the server rendered view state - by definition, the server and client components will get\n' +
      'the same props. The server component can, in addition, return a server state to the client.</p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> renderCounterElement <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./counter.jay.html'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> createEvent<span class="token punctuation">,</span> createState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> makeJayComponent<span class="token punctuation">,</span> Props <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-component'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      'interface CounterProps <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  initialValue<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  step<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'interface CounterServerState <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">CounterComponent</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">{</span> initialValue<span class="token punctuation">,</span> step <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token operator">:</span> Props<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>CounterProps<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  refs<span class="token operator">:</span> CounterRefs<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  serverState<span class="token operator">:</span> CounterServerState<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>value<span class="token punctuation">,</span> setValue<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createState</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>initialValue<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>inc<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">setValue</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">value</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token function">step</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">setValue</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">value</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">-</span> <span class="token function">step</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> onChange <span class="token operator">=</span> createEvent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>number<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>emitter<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> emitter<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">emit</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">value</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    render<spa'... 3940 more characters,
