{
  post: {
    title: 'Documentation Gaps And Updates',
    content: '<h1>Documentation Gaps and Updates</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Audited recent design logs (DL#84–DL#113) against current docs in <code>docs/core/</code>, <code>docs/getting-started/</code>, and <code>packages/jay-stack/stack-cli/agent-kit-template/</code>. Several features implemented over recent development cycles lack corresponding documentation.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Documentation Health</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Well documented</strong> (no action needed):</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Three-phase rendering (slow/fast/interactive) — <code>docs/core/jay-stack.md</code>, <code>docs/core/contract-files.md</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Component types (headfull/headless, client-only/full-stack) — <code>docs/core/components.md</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Promise/async view state — <code>docs/core/jay-html.md</code>, <code>docs/core/contract-files.md</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Basic jay-html syntax — <code>docs/core/jay-html.md</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Server actions — <code>docs/core/server-actions.md</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Render pipeline — <code>docs/core/render-pipeline.md</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Gaps identified below.</strong></p>\n' +
      '<h2>Gap 1: Nested Headless Components</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Design logs</strong>: DL#84 (props, repeater support), DL#90 (interactive forEach), DL#102 (SSR/hydration)</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Current docs</strong>: <code>docs/core/jay-html.md</code> lines 219-313 covers basics (instance-based, key-based, props, inline templates). Agent-kit <code>jay-html-syntax.md</code> lines 126-202 also covers this well.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Missing</strong>:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Phase constraints — headless instances inside forEach require the array to be <code>slow</code> phase (DL#90 explains why fast/interactive-only instances aren&#39;t supported inside forEach)</li>\n' +
      '<li>How headless instance SSR works — server-element compilation renders instances using <code>__headlessInstances</code> ViewState lookup</li>\n' +
      '<li>The <code>ref</code> attribute on <code>&lt;jay:xxx&gt;</code> — auto-generated <code>AR0</code>, <code>AR1</code> vs explicit refs</li>\n' +
      '<li>Coordinate system for headless instances — how trackBy values map to <code>__headlessInstances</code> keys</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Where to update</strong>: <code>docs/core/jay-html.md</code> (headless components section), <code>agent-kit-template/jay-html-syntax.md</code></p>\n' +
      '<h2>Gap 2: Headfull Nested Full-Stack Components</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Design log</strong>: DL#111</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Current docs</strong>: <code>docs/core/jay-html.md</code> lines 189-217 documents client-only headfull imports (<code>&lt;script type=&quot;application/jay-headfull&quot;&gt;</code>). No mention of the <code>contract</code> attribute for full-stack headfull.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Missing</strong>:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>contract</code> attribute on <code>application/jay-headfull</code> — makes the component full-stack (slow/fast phases, SSR)</li>\n' +
      '<li>How template injection works — component&#39;s jay-html body is injected into <code>&lt;jay:Name&gt;</code> tags</li>\n' +
      '<li>Component jay-html structure (separate jay-html with <code>application/jay-data</code> and body)</li>\n' +
      '<li>When to use headfull FS vs headless (headfull owns its UI, headless delegates UI to parent)</li>\n' +
      '<li>CSS from component jay-html is merged into the page</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
