{
  post: {
    title: 'Fast Phase Query Parameters',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #117: Fast-Phase Query Parameters</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Jay Stack supports URL <strong>path parameters</strong> via file-system routing (<code>[slug]</code>, <code>[[optional]]</code>, <code>[...catchAll]</code>). These are extracted by the route scanner, merged with <code>inferredParams</code> (DL#113), and passed as props to both slow and fast render phases.</p>\n' +
      '<p>URL <strong>query parameters</strong> (<code>?page=2&amp;sort=price</code>) have no dedicated support. The raw URL string is available in <code>PageProps.url</code> but never parsed. Components wanting query params must parse the URL themselves.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Current data flow</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">Request: GET /products/vases?page=2&amp;sort=price\n' +
      '\n' +
      'dev-server.ts:\n' +
      "  pageParams  = { slug: 'vases' }               ← path params (from Express + inferredParams)\n" +
      "  pageProps   = { language: 'en', url: '/products/vases?page=2&amp;sort=price' }\n" +
      '\n' +
      'slowly-changing-runner.ts:\n' +
      '  props = { ...pageProps, ...pageParams }        ← slow phase sees raw url only\n' +
      '\n' +
      'fast-changing-runner.ts:\n' +
      '  props = { ...pageProps, ...pageParams }        ← fast phase sees raw url only</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>No ergonomic way to access query parameters — component authors must manually parse <code>props.url</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>No phase-appropriate boundary — query params are per-request data, but there&#39;s no type-level distinction between slow (cached/SSG) and fast (per-request) data sources</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Why query params don&#39;t belong in the slow phase</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Slow render results are cached per route + path params (<code>SlowRenderCache</code> in <code>slow-render-cache.ts</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Query params change frequently (<code>?page=1</code>, <code>?page=2</code>, <code>?sort=name</code>, etc.)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Including query params in slow phase would either bust the cache on every distinct query string, or serve stale cached content</li>\n' +
      '<li>Conceptually, slow phase is build-time/SSG — query params don&#39;t exist at build time</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Why query params belong in the fast phase</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Fast phase runs per-request (SSR)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Query params modify <em>how</em> a resource is displayed (pagination, sorting, filtering), not <em>which</em> resource</li>\n' +
      '<li>Fast phase already receives per-request data (<code>pageProps</code>, <code>pageParams</code>)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>New type: <code>RequestQuery</code></h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// jay-stack-types.ts</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface RequestQuery <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  query<span class="token operator">:</span> Record<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>string<span class="token punctuation">,</span> string<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Type-safe fast-only access</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Change <code>RenderFast</code> to intersect <code>PropsT</code> with <code>RequestQuery</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// Before</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> type RenderFast<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>Services<span class="token punctuation">,</span> PropsT<span class="token punctuation">,</span> FastViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> FastCarryForward<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  props<span class="token operator">:</span> PropsT<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>services<span class="token operator">:</span> Services\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> Promise<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>FastRenderResult<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>FastViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> FastCarryForward<span class="token operator">&gt;&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// After</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> type RenderFast<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>Services<span class="token punctuation">,</span> PropsT<span class="token punctuation">,</span> FastViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> FastCarryForward<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  props<span class="token operator">:</span> PropsT <span class="token operator">&amp;</span> RequestQuery<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>services<span class="token operator">:</span> Services\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> Promise<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>FastRenderResult<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>FastViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> FastCarryForward<span class="token operator">&gt;&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><code>RenderSlowly</code> stays unchanged — <code>props: PropsT</code> has no <code>query</code> field.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Result</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// ✅ Fast phase — query is available</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withFastRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">async </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> carryForward<span class="token punctuation">,</span> dbService<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `    <span class="token keyword">const</span> page <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">parseInt</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>query<span class="token punctuation">.</span>page <span class="token operator">||</span> <span class="token string">'1'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `    <span class="token keyword">const</span> sort <span class="token operator">=</span> props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>query<span class="token punctuation">.</span>sort <span class="token operator">||</span> <span class="token string">'name'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> products <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">await</span> dbService<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getProducts</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> page<span class="token punctuation">,</span> sort <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">// ...</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// ❌ Slow phase — query does NOT exist on props (type error)</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withSlowlyRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">async </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> dbService<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `    props<span class="token punctuation">.</span>query  <span class="token comment">// ← TypeScript error: Property 'query' does not exist</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token comment">// ...</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Runtime changes</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Parse query params from the request in <code>dev-server.ts</code> and pass to <code>renderFastChangingData</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// dev-server.ts — inside mkRoute handler</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> urlObj <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">new</span> <span class="token function">URL</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>req<span class="token punctuation">.</span>originalUrl<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">`http://${req.headers.host}`</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> query<span class="token operator">:</span> Record<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>string<span class="token punctuation">,</span> string<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">for </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>key<span class="token punctuation">,</span> value<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token keyword">of</span> urlObj<span class="token punctuation">.</span>searchParams<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  query<span class="token punctuation">[</span>key<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> value<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// last value wins for rep'... 16934 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Fast Phase Query Parameters","number":117}'
  }
}
