{
  post: {
    title: 'Jay-Html-Compiler Refactor',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #118 — jay-html-compiler.ts Refactor</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p><code>jay-html-compiler.ts</code> is 4,813 lines containing 5 compilation targets (element, bridge, hydrate, server, sandbox) mixed together with shared utilities. The file is difficult to navigate and — more critically — contains duplicated algorithms across targets that drift out of sync when features are added.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Two interrelated problems:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>File size</strong>: 4,813 lines in a single file makes navigation and ownership difficult</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Cross-target duplication</strong>: Similar algorithms are copy-pasted across targets with subtle inconsistencies already present (e.g., missing validation in server slowForEach, inconsistent null-safety in child filtering)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>The duplication means adding a new directive or feature requires updating 3-4 places with no compiler enforcement that they stay consistent.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Duplicated Patterns Identified</h2>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Pattern</th>\n' +
      '<th>Occurrences</th>\n' +
      '<th>Example inconsistency</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td>Child node filtering (remove whitespace text)</td>\n' +
      '<td>14x</td>\n' +
      '<td>Element uses <code>_.innerText.trim()</code>, hydrate/server use <code>(_.innerText || &#39;&#39;).trim()</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Accessor validation (parse → JayUnknown → isArray)</td>\n' +
      '<td>8x</td>\n' +
      '<td>—</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Attribute skip list</td>\n' +
      '<td>4x</td>\n' +
      '<td>Server adds <code>data-jay-dynamic</code>, others don&#39;t</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>forEach setup (validate + child vars + fragment)</td>\n' +
      '<td>4x</td>\n' +
      '<td>—</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Headless instance setup (find import, names, coords)</td>\n' +
      '<td>3x</td>\n' +
      '<td>—</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Contract type replacement (2→5 param)</td>\n' +
      '<td>3x</td>\n' +
      '<td>Definition file uses string match, others use regex</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>renderNestedComponent</td>\n' +
      '<td>2x</td>\n' +
      '<td>Element has secureChildComp branch, bridge doesn&#39;t</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Headless coordinate extraction</td>\n' +
      '<td>3x</td>\n' +
      '<td>Nearly identical across element, hydrate, server</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Headless ref map building (collectContractRefs)</td>\n' +
      '<td>2x</td>\n' +
      '<td>Identical in element and hydrate</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Extract shared algorithms into reusable helpers FIRST (small, safe steps), then split the file by target. Each step is independently testable — run <code>yarn test</code> in the package after each.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Shared helpers to extract</h3>\n' +
      '<p>All go into <code>jay-html-compiler-shared.ts</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>a) <code>filterContentNodes(nodes)</code></strong> — replaces 14 occurrences of the child-filtering pattern. Uses the safe <code>(_.innerText || &#39;&#39;).trim()</code> variant everywhere.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>b) <code>isDirectiveAttribute(attrCanonical)</code></strong> — replaces the 4 skip-list checks. Returns <code>true</code> for <code>if</code>, <code>forEach</code>, <code>trackBy</code>, <code>ref</code>, <code>slowForEach</code>, <code>jayIndex</code>, <code>jayTrackBy</code>, <code>jay-coordinate-base</code>, <code>data-jay-dynamic</code>, and the async directives. Each call site can pass an optional <code>extra</code> set for target-specific additions.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>c) <code>validateForEachAccessor(forEach, variables)</code></strong> — replaces the 4 forEach validation blocks. Returns <code>{ accessor, variables, fragment, error? }</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>d) <code>validateSlowForEachAccessor(arrayName, variables)</code></strong> — replaces the 2 slowForEach validation blocks (and adds the missing validation to server target).</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>e) <code>validateAsyncAccessor(property, variables)</code></strong> — replaces the 2 async validation blocks.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>f) <code>replaceContractType(renderedElement, baseName, jayFile)</code></strong> — replaces the 3 contract-type replacement blocks.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>g) <code>resolveHeadlessImport(contractName, headlessImports)</code></strong> — replaces the 3 &quot;find import or return error&quot; blocks.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>h) <code>generateHeadlessTypeNames(contractName, idx)</code></strong> — replaces the 3 blocks that compute pascal, componentSymbol, renderFnName, type names.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>i) <code>extractHeadlessCoordinate(element, contractName)</code></strong> — replaces the 3 blocks that read <code>jay-coordinate-base</code>, split segments, extract suffix.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>j) <code>buildContractRefMap(refsTree)</code></strong> — replaces the 2 identical <code>collectContractRefs</code> implementations.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Implementation Plan</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 1: Extract leaf helpers (no structural changes)</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Each step: extract one helper, replace all call sites, run tests.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 1: <code>filterContentNodes</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Create <code>jay-html-compiler-shared.ts</code> with this function</li>\n' +
      '<li>Replace all 14 occurrences</li>\n' +
      '<li>Fix inconsistency: use safe <code>(_.innerText || &#39;&#39;).trim()</code> everywhere</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 2: <code>isDirectiveAttribute</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Add to shared module</li>\n' +
      '<li>Replace 4 skip-list blocks</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 3: <code>validateForEachAccessor</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Add to shared module</li>\n' +
      '<li>Replace 4 forEach validation blocks</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 4: <code>validateSlowForEachAccessor</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Add to shared module</li>\n' +
      '<li>Replace 2 slowForEach validation blocks</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 5: <code>validateAsyncAccessor</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Add to shared module</li>\n' +
      '<li>Replace 2 async validation blocks</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 6: <code>replaceContractType</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Add to shared module</li>\n' +
      '<li>Replace 3 contract-type replacement blocks</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 7: Headless helpers (<code>resolveHeadlessImport</code>, <code>generateHeadlessTypeNames</code>, <code>extractHeadlessCoordinate</code>, <code>buildContractRefMap</code>)</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Add all 4 to shared module</li>\n' +
      '<li>Replace call sites in element, hydrate, server targets</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 2: Extract phase helpers</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 8: <code>jay-html-compiler-phase.ts</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Move <code>buildInteractivePaths</code>, <code>textHasInteractiveBindings</code>, <code>extractConditionIdentifiers</code>, <code>conditionIsInteractive</code>, <code>simplifyConditionForHydrate</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Update imports in main file</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 3: Split by target</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Each step: move one target&#39;s functions to its own file, update imports, keep public API in main file.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Step 9: Extract server target → <code>jay-html-compiler-server.ts</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Move: <code>ServerContext</code>, <code>getCoordinateExpr</code>, <code>w</code>, <code>renderServerNode</code>, <code>renderServerElement</code>, <code>renderServerHeadlessInstance</code>, <code>renderServerElementContent</code>, <code>renderServerOpenTag</code>, <code>renderServerAttributes</code>, <code>renderServerNodeAsString</code>, <code>renderServerElementAsString</code>, <code>renderServerForEachAsString</code>, <code>renderServerAttributesAsString</code>, <code>collectAsyncGroups</code>, <code>renderServerAsyncGroup</code>, <code>hasDynamicAttributeBindings</code>, <code>hasInteractiveChildElements</code>, <code>hasMixedContentDynamicText</code>, <code>hasMixedContentDynamicTextInteractive</code>, <code>mergeServerFragments</code>, <code>voidElements</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Keep <code>generateServerElementFile</code> in main file (thin orchestrator) or move with it</li>\n' +
      '<li>Validate: <code>yarn test</code></li>\n' +
