{
  post: {
    title: 'ForEach Conditional Hydration',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #121 — forEach Conditional Hydration</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>In jay-html, <code>j-if</code>/<code>j-else</code> conditions inside a <code>forEach</code> render correctly during SSR but fail to toggle after hydration. The condition update is silently ignored.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Related Design Logs</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>#93 — Client hydration</li>\n' +
      '<li>#99 — Hydration coordinate alignment bugs</li>\n' +
      '<li>#100 — Hydrate conditional creation fallback</li>\n' +
      '<li>#106 — Hydrate dynamic elements with Kindergarten</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Given this template:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;item&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">forEach</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;items&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">trackBy</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;_id&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{name}<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;badge&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">if</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;isActive&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Active<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;badge-off&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">if</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;!isActive&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Inactive<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;toggleButton&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>Toggle<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Initial SSR render is correct — items with <code>isActive=true</code> show &quot;Active&quot;, others show &quot;Inactive&quot;. But clicking &quot;Toggle&quot; does nothing. The condition never updates.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Root Cause</h3>\n' +
      '<p><code>hydrateConditional</code> needs a <code>KindergartenGroup</code> (set via <code>_setGroup</code>) to insert/remove DOM nodes when the condition changes. This group is assigned by <code>adoptDynamicElement</code>, which creates a Kindergarten and iterates children, calling <code>_setGroup</code> on dynamic ones.</p>\n' +
      '<p>But forEach items bypass <code>adoptDynamicElement</code>. The compiler generates either:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Flat array</strong> (no item adoption needed): <code>() =&gt; [hydrateConditional(...), hydrateConditional(...)]</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><strong><code>adoptElement</code></strong> (item has dynamic attrs/ref): <code>() =&gt; [adoptElement(&quot;&quot;, attrs, [hydrateConditional(...)])]</code></li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>Neither <code>hydrateForEach</code>&#39;s flat-array handling (hydrate.ts:462-476) nor <code>adoptElement</code> (hydrate.ts:218-220) creates a Kindergarten or calls <code>_setGroup</code>. The conditional&#39;s <code>group</code> stays <code>null</code>, and updates bail out at <code>if (!group) return;</code> (hydrate.ts:360).</p>\n' +
      '<p>For comparison, regular elements with conditional children use <code>adoptDynamicElement</code> (compiler detects <code>hasInteractiveChildren</code> at line 963 and switches at line 1039).</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Reproduction</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Test 10c (<code>packages/jay-stack/dev-server/test/10c-nested-conditional/</code>) now includes a toggle button and interactive phase. SSR disabled mode passes (element target handles conditionals correctly). SSR modes fail on interactivity — the toggle has no effect.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Approach: Generate <code>adoptDynamicElement</code> for forEach items with interactive children</h3>\n' +
      '<p>The compiler already generates <code>adoptDynamicElement</code> with <code>STATIC</code> sentinels for regular elements with interactive children (jay-html-compiler-hydrate.ts lines 1039-1092). Apply the same pattern to forEach item adoption.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>packages/compiler/compiler-jay-html/lib/jay-target/jay-html-compiler-hydrate.ts</code></p>\n' +
      '<p>In the forEach adopt body generation (lines 296-334):</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Compute <code>itemHasInteractiveChildren</code> — same check as line 963-972: any direct child is an interactive conditional or a nested forEach</li>\n' +
      '<li>When true, generate <code>adoptDynamicElement(&quot;&quot;, attrs, [STATIC, hydrateConditional(...), hydrateConditional(...), STATIC])</code> — the item wrapper creates a Kindergarten and calls <code>_setGroup</code> on dynamic children</li>\n' +
      '<li>When <code>needsItemAdoption</code> without interactive children — keep <code>adoptElement</code> (existing path)</li>\n' +
      '<li>When neither — keep flat array (existing path)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>When both <code>itemHasInteractiveChildren</code> and <code>needsItemAdoption</code> are true, <code>adoptDynamicElement</code> handles everything (it calls <code>adoptBase</code> internally, which handles dynamic attrs and refs).</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Generated Code Example</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Before (broken):</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-javascript"><span class="token function">hydrateForEach</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> vs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>items<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'_id'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>\n' +
      `        <span class="token function">adoptText</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0/0'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> vs1 <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> vs1<span class="token punctuation">.</span>name<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      `        <span class="token function">hydrateConditional</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs1 <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> vs1<span class="token punctuation">.</span>isActive<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">adoptElement</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0/1'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      `        <span class="token function">hydrateConditional</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs1 <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token operator">!</span>vs1<span class="token punctuation">.</span>isActive<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">adoptElement</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'0/2'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">(</span>item<span class="token punctuation">,</span> id<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>After (fixed):</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-javascript"><span class="token function">hydrateForEach</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>vs <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> vs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>items<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'_id'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>\n' +
      '        <span class="token function">adoptDynamicElement</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><s'... 7381 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"ForEach Conditional Hydration","number":121}'
  }
}
