{
  post: {
    title: 'Deeply Nested Headfull And Headless Components',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #123: Deeply Nested Headfull and Headless Components</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>DL#111 introduced headfull full-stack components — components that bring their own jay-html template and participate in three-phase rendering (slow/fast/interactive). The implementation reuses the headless instance pipeline by injecting the headfull component&#39;s template body into matching <code>&lt;jay:Name&gt;</code> tags at parse time. After injection, the component is compiled identically to a headless instance.</p>\n' +
      '<p>This works well for single-level usage: a page imports a headfull FS component and uses it. But real applications need deeper composition — a layout component containing a header, a header containing a cart indicator, or a page-level keyed headless whose data flows into a headfull component&#39;s template.</p>\n' +
      '<p>This design log analyzes three nesting scenarios that are currently unsupported or broken, with concrete examples of what fails and why.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Related Design Logs</h2>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>DL#84</strong> — Headless component props and repeater support (<code>&lt;jay:xxx&gt;</code> syntax)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>DL#90</strong> — Headless instances in interactive forEach (no slow phase)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>DL#102</strong> — Headless instance SSR and hydration compilation</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>DL#105</strong> — Headless component client defaults</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>DL#111</strong> — Nested headfull full-stack components (template injection)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Three composition patterns that users need are not supported:</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Scenario A: Headfull FS with a page-level keyed headless</h3>\n' +
      '<p>A page has a headfull FS header and a page-level keyed headless for the cart. The header&#39;s template needs to show the cart item count.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Scenario B: Headfull FS inside headfull FS</h3>\n' +
      '<p>A page uses a layout component, and the layout&#39;s own jay-html uses a header component.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Scenario C: Headless instance inside headfull FS template</h3>\n' +
      '<p>A headfull FS header component&#39;s jay-html contains a <code>&lt;jay:cart-indicator&gt;</code> headless instance from a plugin.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Analysis</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Scenario A: Headfull FS + page-level keyed headless</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>What the developer writes:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<p>Page <code>page.jay-html</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span>\n' +
