      '    dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>What breaks:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><p><code>parseHeadfullFSImports</code> reads <code>header.jay-html</code> but only extracts the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> content (line 949). The <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> with its <code>&lt;script type=&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;&gt;</code> is ignored.</p>\n' +
