      '<li><p>The injected template <code>&lt;span&gt;{cart.itemCount} items&lt;/span&gt;</code> is compiled within <code>renderHeadlessInstance</code> against the Header contract&#39;s ViewState (<code>componentVariables = new Variables(headlessImport.rootType)</code> at <code>jay-html-compiler.ts:764</code>). The Header contract has no <code>cart</code> tag, so <code>{cart.itemCount}</code> fails compilation.</p>\n' +
