    content: '<h1>Redo Events</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Reminder</p>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<p>Reminder from <a href="05-events">Events</a> we have chosen to create events using the ref object</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">dec</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>event</code> parameter is the native DOM event object.</p>\n' +
      '<p>For events on elements under a <code>forEach</code> construct, we also get the data item</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>label<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">dec</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Again, the <code>event</code> is the native DOM event object, while the viewState\n' +
      'is the current data object from the latest <code>forEach</code> relative to the element.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>New Requirements</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Incorporating into the requirements for events the needs from <a href="12-secure-architecture">secure architecture</a>\n' +
      'we need to change the events model a bit different</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Support secure context, which means event handler does not have access to the DOM</li>\n' +
      '<li>Support scoped access to the DOM, which enables<ol>\n' +
      '<li>secure and custom logic</li>\n' +
      '<li>reading values from the DOM</li>\n' +
      '<li>returning values to the event handler</li>\n' +
      '<li>conditionally invoke &#39;APIs gated by user activation&#39;</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li>Unify the event handler for static and <code>forEach</code> elements</li>\n' +
      '<li>Getting the element coordinate to facilitate main to sandbox communication</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>The New (low level) API</h2>\n' +
      '<p>presented are 4 variants of the API\n' +
      '(the compiler can introduce higher level abstractions over the API, making it more user friendly)</p>\n' +
      '<p>// with native handler (which can be secure)</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">nativeHandler</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">return</span> event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>target<span class="token punctuation">.</span>value<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">handler</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>value<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">onclickNative</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">return</span> event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>target<span class="token punctuation">.</span>value<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">then</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>value<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">native</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>target<span class="token punctuation">.</span>value<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">then</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>value<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createNativeEvent</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>target<span class="token punctuation">.</span>value<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">then</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>value<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>// without native handler</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">handler</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">onclick</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>onclick <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createEvent</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Investigating code completion for the event type and view state types, we see that\n' +
