[Build] 61/1235 /design-log/jay/[slug] (slug=14-references-api)
{
  post: {
    title: 'Production Smoke Test',
    content: '<h1>DL#140: Production Smoke Test Example</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The fake-shop example has a dev-mode smoke test (<code>test/smoke.test.ts</code>) that starts the dev server, hits pages, and checks SSR output. But there&#39;s no validation of production builds, no coverage of the new deployment modes from DL#139 (self-hosted vs CDN), and the fake-shop mixes too many concerns to serve as a systematic configuration test.</p>\n' +
      '<p>We need a dedicated example project where each page isolates a specific configuration, and a smoke test suite that validates all four serving modes:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Dev mode</strong> — <code>jay-stack dev --test-mode</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Production http + self-hosted</strong> — <code>jay-stack build</code> + <code>jay-stack serve --env local</code> (Node HTTP server serves static files)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Production http + CDN</strong> — <code>jay-stack build</code> + <code>jay-stack serve --env http-cdn</code> (Node HTTP server, static files on separate server)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Production fetch + CDN</strong> — <code>jay-stack build</code> + <code>jay-stack serve --env production</code> (fetch handler, static files on separate server)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>The build is environment-agnostic (DL#139) — same build output serves all environments. <code>--env</code> is serve-time only.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>No production build validation exists — we don&#39;t know if built artifacts actually serve correctly</li>\n' +
      '<li>No validation of the frontend/backend split from DL#139</li>\n' +
      '<li>No CDN-mode testing — import maps, CSS links, and client bundles referencing external URLs</li>\n' +
      '<li>Different page configurations (headless, headfull, actions, dynamic routes, async data, public assets) aren&#39;t tested in isolation — a failure in fake-shop doesn&#39;t tell you which configuration broke</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Example Project: <code>examples/jay-stack/smoke-test</code></h3>\n' +
      '<p>A project where each page tests one specific feature configuration. Pages are minimal — just enough to prove the configuration works.</p>\n' +
      '<h4>Pages</h4>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Route</th>\n' +
      '<th>What it tests</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Static page, no contract, no code — just jay-html</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/phases</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>All three rendering phases (slow + fast + interactive) with a contract</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/headless</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Headless component from a local plugin</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/headfull</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Headfull full-stack component with its own jay-html</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/actions</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Server action (query + mutation) with service injection</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/dynamic/[slug]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Dynamic route with <code>loadParams</code>, two instances</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/async-data</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Async data in slow and fast phases</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/public-assets</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Page referencing images/files from the <code>public/</code> folder</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/foreach</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>forEach</code> and <code>slowForEach</code> rendering</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/nested</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Nested headless inside headfull, headfull inside headfull</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<h4>Plugins</h4>\n' +
      '<p>One local test plugin (<code>src/plugins/test-plugin/</code>) providing:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>A headless contract + component (used by <code>/headless</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li>A service (used by <code>/actions</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li>A webhook (validates invalidation in renderer mode)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Public Folder</h4>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">public/\n' +
      '  images/\n' +
      '    test-image.png    # Small 1x1 PNG for validation\n' +
      '  data/\n' +
      '    test.json         # Static JSON file</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h4>Deploy Config</h4>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token comment"># .jay-deploy</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">environments</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '  local<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '    serverStyle<span class="token punctuation">:</span> http\n' +
      '    serveStaticFiles<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  http<span class="token punctuation">-</span>cdn<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '    serverStyle<span class="token punctuation">:</span> http\n' +
      '    serveStaticFiles<span class="token punctuation">:</span> false\n' +
      '    staticBaseUrl<span class="token punctuation">:</span> http<span class="token punctuation">:</span>//localhost<span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token number">4001</span>/\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  production<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '    serverStyle<span class="token punctuation">:</span> fetch\n' +
      '    serveStaticFiles<span class="token punctuation">:</span> false\n' +
      '    staticBaseUrl<span class="token punctuation">:</span> http<span class="token punctuation">:</span>//localhost<span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token number">4001</span>/</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The CDN environments point to a local static file server started by the test harness. This validates that URLs resolve correctly without needing a real CDN. Testing both <code>http</code> and <code>fetch</code> server styles with CDN ensures the fetch handler works identically in both wrappings.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Smoke Test Structure</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Single test file: <code>test/smoke.test.ts</code></p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="">describe('smoke-test smoke')\n` +
      "  describe('dev mode')\n" +
      '    for each page: fetch and validate\n' +
      '\n' +
      "  describe('production')\n" +
      '    beforeAll: build once (environment-agnostic)\n' +
      '\n' +
      "    describe('http + self-hosted')\n" +
      '      beforeAll: start server --env local\n' +
      '      for each page: fetch and validate\n' +
      '\n' +
      "    describe('http + cdn')\n" +
      '      beforeAll: start server --env http-cdn + static file server\n' +
      '      for each page: fetch and validate\n' +
      '\n' +
      "    describe('fetch + cdn')\n" +
      '      beforeAll: start server --env production + static file server\n' +
      '      for each page: fetch and validate\n' +
      '\n' +
      '    afterAll: stop all servers</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h4>Per-Page Validation</h4>\n' +
      '<p>Each page gets a validation function that checks its specific concern:</p>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Page</th>\n' +
      '<th>Validation</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Returns 200, contains expected static HTML</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/phases</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>SSR output has slow data baked in, fast data rendered, hydration script present</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/headless</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Headless component&#39;s HTML present in SSR output</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/headfull</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Headfull component&#39;s HTML present, its CSS loaded</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/actions</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Action endpoint responds correctly to GET query and POST mutation</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/dynamic/item-a</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Correct instance rendered with item-a params</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/dynamic/item-b</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Correct instance rendered with item-b params</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/async-data</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Async swap scripts present in output</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/public-assets</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code> src points to correct URL (self-hosted: <code>/public/...</code>, CDN: <code>http://localhost:4001/public/...</code>)</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/foreach</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Repeated elements present in SSR output</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/nested</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Nested components rendered at correct coordinates</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<h4>CDN-Specific Validation</h4>\n' +
      '<p>In CDN mode, additionally check:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Import map URLs start with <code>http://localhost:4001/</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>CSS <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> href starts with <code>http://localhost:4001/</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Client bundle <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> src starts with <code>http://localhost:4001/</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Static file server responds to shared chunk requests</li>\n' +
      '<li>Static file server responds to instance bundle requests</li>\n' +
      '<li>Public assets served from static file server</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Static File Server for CDN Tests</h4>\n' +
      '<p>The test harness starts a minimal HTTP server that serves <code>build/v{n}/frontend/</code> on port 4001. This simulates a CDN.</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">async</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">startStaticServer</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>frontendDir<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">,</span> port<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> Promise<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ChildProcess<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">// Simple static file server over the frontend/ folder</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Test Harness Utilities</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Extracted from fake-shop&#39;s smoke test into a shared helper:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">interface SmokeTestServer <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  url<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">stop</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> Promise<span class="token operator">&lt;</span><span class="token keyword">void</span><span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">async</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">startDevServer</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>projectDir<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">,</span> port<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="tok'... 12999 more characters,
