{
  post: {
    title: 'Npm Create Jay',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #153 — npm create jay</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Setting up a new Jay Stack project requires multiple manual steps: creating the directory structure, installing packages, writing boilerplate files, running <code>agent-kit</code>, and running <code>setup</code>. We want a single <code>npm create jay</code> command that scaffolds a working project with the user&#39;s choice of plugins.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Related</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>DL#86 — Jay Stack full workflow lifecycle</li>\n' +
      '<li>DL#87 — Jay-stack setup command</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Command</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">npm</span> <span class="token function">create</span> <span class="token function">jay</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token comment"># or</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">yarn</span> <span class="token function">create</span> <span class="token function">jay</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token comment"># or</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">npx</span> create-jay</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Interactive Flow</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n' +
      '│  🐦 Create Jay Stack Project            │\n' +
      '└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n' +
      '\n' +
      '? Project name: my-store\n' +
      '? Select plugins to install:\n' +
      '  ◉ @jay-framework/ui-kit\n' +
      '  ◉ @jay-framework/a11y-validator\n' +
      '  ◉ @jay-framework/seo-validator\n' +
      '  ◉ @jay-framework/design-system-validator\n' +
      '  ◯ @jay-framework/wix-stores\n' +
      '  ◯ @jay-framework/wix-members\n' +
      '  ◯ @jay-framework/wix-media\n' +
      '  ◯ @jay-framework/wix-data\n' +
      '  ◯ @jay-framework/aiditor\n' +
      '\n' +
      'Creating project in ./my-store...\n' +
      '  ✓ Created project structure\n' +
      '  ✓ Installed dependencies\n' +
      '  ✓ Generated agent-kit\n' +
      '  ✓ Plugin setup complete\n' +
      '\n' +
      '┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n' +
      '│  🐦 Ready!                             │\n' +
      '│                                         │\n' +
      '│  cd my-store                            │\n' +
      '│  yarn dev                               │\n' +
      '└─────────────────────────────────────────┘</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Package: <code>create-jay</code></h3>\n' +
      '<p>Lives at <code>packages/jay-stack/create-jay</code>. Published as <code>create-jay</code> on npm (the <code>create-</code> prefix is what makes <code>npm create jay</code> work).</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">create-jay/\n' +
      '  lib/\n' +
      '    index.ts          # CLI entry point\n' +
      '    prompts.ts        # Interactive prompts (project name, plugin selection)\n' +
      '    scaffold.ts       # Create directory structure, write template files\n' +
      '    plugins.ts        # Plugin registry (available packages, descriptions, groups)\n' +
      '  templates/\n' +
      '    page.jay-html     # Minimal homepage template\n' +
      '    page.ts           # Minimal page component\n' +
      '    page.jay-contract # Minimal page contract\n' +
      '    styles.css        # Basic theme CSS\n' +
      '    .jay              # Project config\n' +
      '  package.json\n' +
      '  tsconfig.json</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Template Files</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Minimal project scaffolded:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">my-store/\n' +
      '  src/\n' +
      '    pages/\n' +
      '      page.jay-html\n' +
      '      page.ts\n' +
      '      page.jay-contract\n' +
      '    styles/\n' +
      '      theme.css\n' +
      '  .jay\n' +
      '  package.json\n' +
      '  tsconfig.json</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>page.jay-html</code> is a minimal but complete page:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;title</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>My Store<span class="token tag">&lt;/title</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-data&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;./page.jay-contract&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;link</span> <span class="token attribute">rel</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">href</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;../styles/theme.css&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;main</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{title}<span class="token tag">&lt;/h1</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;p</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{description}<span class="token tag">&lt;/p</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/main</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Plugin Registry</h3>\n' +
      '<p>The create command knows about available plugins from a built-in registry:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">interface PluginEntry <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  name<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// npm package name</span>\n' +
      '  label<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// display name</span>\n' +
      '  description<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// one-line description</span>\n' +
      `  group<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// grouping: 'Jay Framework', 'Wix', 'AIditor'</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token keyword">default</span><span class="token operator">:</span> boolean<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// pre-selected in the checkbox menu</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Groups:</p>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Group</th>\n' +
      '<th>Packages</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td>Jay Framework</td>\n' +
      '<td>ui-kit, a11y-validator, seo-validator, design-system-validator</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Wix</td>\n' +
      '<td>wix-stores, wix-members, wix-media, wix-data</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>AIditor</td>\n' +
      '<td>aiditor</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<p>Jay Framework packages are pre-selected by default. Wix and AIditor are opt-in.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Generated package.json</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-json"><span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;my-store&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;version&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;0.1.0&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;module&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;private&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token keyword">true</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;scripts&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
