{
  post: {
    title: 'Setup Pipeline Re-Initialization',
    content: '<h1>DL#159 — Setup Pipeline Re-initialization</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>jay-stack-cli setup</code> command runs plugin setup handlers to configure credentials, create config files, and validate services. Plugins declare dependencies on each other — for example, <code>wix-stores</code>, <code>wix-data</code>, <code>wix-members</code>, and <code>wix-media</code> all depend on <code>wix-server-client</code> providing the <code>WixClientService</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>On a freshly scaffolded project, <code>jay-stack-cli setup</code> fails in cascade:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>All plugin inits run upfront</strong> before any setup handler executes. <code>wix-server-client</code> init fails because <code>config/.wix.yaml</code> doesn&#39;t exist yet. All dependent plugins also fail because <code>WixClientService</code> was never registered.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>No re-initialization between plugins.</strong> Even in interactive mode, after <code>wix-server-client</code> setup successfully creates <code>.wix.yaml</code> and configures the API key, subsequent plugins still see stale <code>initError</code> because the service registry isn&#39;t refreshed.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Noisy error output.</strong> <code>[PluginInit] Failed to execute server init for &quot;wix-stores&quot;</code> logs unconditionally for every plugin, even though these failures are expected — setup&#39;s job is to fix them.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Scaffolded <code>npm run setup</code> lacks <code>--interactive</code>.</strong> The generated script runs <code>jay-stack-cli setup</code> without the flag, so users don&#39;t get prompted.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Setup-first, then init per plugin</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Currently the pipeline does two bulk phases: init all plugins, then setup all plugins. This is backwards — init reads config files that setup creates.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Instead, for each plugin in dependency order: setup first, then init:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">for each plugin (dependency order):\n' +
      '  1. setup (create config, prompt for credentials)\n' +
      '  2. init  (read config, register services)\n' +
      '  3. → next plugin</code></pre>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">┌─────────────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n' +
      '│ wix-server-client           │     │ wix-stores                  │\n' +
      '│  setup → creates .wix.yaml  │     │  setup → creates config     │\n' +
      '│  init  → reads .wix.yaml    │────►│  (WixClientService exists)  │\n' +
      '│       → registers WixClient │     │  init  → registers stores   │\n' +
      '└─────────────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────────────┘</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>After <code>wix-server-client</code> setup creates <code>.wix.yaml</code> and init registers <code>WixClientService</code>, <code>wix-stores</code> setup finds the service available. No bulk clear/re-init needed — the service registry accumulates naturally.</p>\n' +
      '<p>If a plugin&#39;s setup returns <code>needs-config</code> or <code>error</code>, skip its init (it would fail anyway). Dependent plugins will also fail gracefully since the service they need was never registered.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Suppress init error logging during setup</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Add a <code>quiet</code> parameter to <code>executePluginServerInits()</code>. When <code>true</code>, init errors are captured in the returned Map but not logged. The setup pipeline handles error reporting itself.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Fix scaffolded setup script</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Change the generated <code>package.json</code> setup script from:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">&quot;setup&quot;: &quot;jay-stack-cli setup&quot;</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>to:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">&quot;setup&quot;: &quot;jay-stack-cli setup --interactive&quot;</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Implementation Plan</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 1: Core changes</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong><code>stack-server-runtime/lib/plugin-init-discovery.ts</code></strong> — add <code>quiet?: boolean</code> param to <code>executePluginServerInits</code>, skip <code>getLogger().error()</code> when quiet. Expose per-plugin init (or allow calling with a single-element array).</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong><code>stack-cli/lib/run-setup.ts</code></strong> — replace bulk init + bulk setup with per-plugin loop: setup → (if configured, init) → next. No need for <code>cli-services.ts</code> <code>initializeServices</code> during setup — init each plugin inline after its setup succeeds.</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong><code>create-jay/lib/scaffold.ts</code></strong> — setup script <code>--interactive</code></li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 2: Verification</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Fresh project with Wix plugins → <code>npm run setup</code> prompts interactively, plugins configure in cascade</li>\n' +
      '<li>No <code>[PluginInit] Failed to execute server init</code> noise during setup</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack-cli setup</code> (non-interactive) — <code>wix-server-client</code> returns <code>needs-config</code>, dependent plugins also return <code>needs-config</code> (not error)</li>\n' +
      '<li>After manual config, re-running <code>jay-stack-cli setup</code> configures all plugins</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Trade-offs</h2>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Choice</th>\n' +
      '<th>Pro</th>\n' +
      '<th>Con</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td>Per-plugin setup+init</td>\n' +
      '<td>Simple, no reset/re-init, natural accumulation</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>run-setup.ts</code> takes over init responsibility from <code>cli-services.ts</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Quiet init errors</td>\n' +
      '<td>Clean output during setup</td>\n' +
      '<td>Debugging harder if init fails for unexpected reasons; mitigated by <code>--verbose</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>--interactive</code> in scaffolded script</td>\n' +
      '<td>Users get prompted by default</td>\n' +
      '<td>Agents calling <code>npm run setup</code> get interactive mode; they should call <code>jay-stack-cli setup</code> directly</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<h2>Implementation Results</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Changes made</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong><code>stack-server-runtime/lib/plugin-init-discovery.ts</code></strong> — added <code>quiet: boolean = false</code> param to <code>executePluginServerInits()</code>. When quiet, init errors are captured in the Map but not logged.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong><code>stack-cli/lib/cli-services.ts</code></strong> — added <code>quiet: boolean = false</code> param to <code>initializeServicesForCli()</code>, threaded to <code>executePluginServerInits</code>.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong><code>stack-cli/lib/run-setup.ts</code></strong> — rewrote to per-plugin setup+init flow:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Removed bulk <code>initializeServices()</code> call</li>\n' +
      '<li>No longer depends on <code>cli-services.ts</code> for init — does it inline per plugin</li>\n' +
      '<li>After each plugin returns <code>configured</code>, runs its init quietly via <code>executePluginServerInits</code> with a single-element array</li>\n' +
      '<li>Project init (<code>src/init.ts</code>) runs once after all plugins</li>\n' +
      '<li>Signature simplified: removed <code>initializeServicesForCli</code> param</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong><code>stack-cli/lib/cli.ts</code></strong> — updated <code>runSetup</code> call to match new signature (3 args instead of 4).</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong><code>create-jay/lib/scaffold.ts</code></strong> — setup script changed to <code>jay-stack-cli setup --interactive</code>.</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Tests</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>stack-cli: 113/113 passing</li>\n' +
      '<li>stack-server-runtime: 152/152 passing</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Log Methodology Note</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> These design logs are written primarily for AI agents as part of the <a href="/design-log">Design Log methodology</a> and made accessible here for human readers. The language and structure are optimized for machine consumption — expect precise, specification-style prose rather than narrative documentation.</p>\n',
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Setup Pipeline Re-Initialization","number":159}'
  }
}
