{
  post: {
    title: 'Context Api',
    content: '<h1>Context API</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Jay has an internal Context API based on the <code>constructionContextStack</code> in <code>runtime.ts</code>, runtime package.</p>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>constructionContextStack</code> manages a stack of <code>ConstructContext</code> which are used for the creation of\n' +
      'jay elements, passing information as a context.</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>ConstructContext</code> is created at the root of elements tree</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>ConstructContext</code> is also created for each <code>forEach</code> element in the tree</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>ConstructContext</code> holds the information for<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>refManager</code> - for creating and managing refs</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>data</code> - the current View State in context, which changes in <code>forEach</code> for the data item</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>forStaticElements</code> - are we in the context of static elements, or dynamic (as in children of <code>forEach</code>)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>Jay has a second internal context API based on <code>componentContextStack</code> in <code>component.ts</code>, component package.</p>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>componentContextStack</code> manages <code>ComponentContext</code> for jay hooks.</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>ComponentContext</code> is created at the root of each component.</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>ComponentContext</code> holds the information for<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>reactive</code> - the reactive state management for the component</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>mounts</code>, <code>unmounts</code> - mount and unmount callbacks for <code>createEffect</code>, called from the\n' +
      'component exposed <code>mount</code> and <code>unmount</code>.</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Proposed Context API</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The proposed API is to be based on the <code>constructionContextStack</code> in <code>runtime.ts</code>, runtime package infra,\n' +
      'exposing the same context to other higher level abstractions including components and secure packages.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Proposed API</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">interface JayContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">/**\n' +
      ' * creates a context marker\n' +
      ' */</span>\n' +
      'declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> createContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType <span class="token operator">=</span> unknown<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> JayContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">/**\n' +
      ' * provides context to child stack frames of the `callback` parameter\n' +
      ' * If a context already exists for the same marker, this one becomes the current one\n' +
      ' * @param context - the context marker\n' +
      ' * @param value - the context value\n' +
      ' * @param callback - the stack frames to provide the context for\n' +
      ' */</span>\n' +
      'declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> provideContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  context<span class="token operator">:</span> JayContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  value<span class="token operator">:</span> ContextType<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  callback<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">/**\n' +
      ' *\n' +
      ' * @param context\n' +
      ' */</span>\n' +
      'declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> useContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>context<span class="token operator">:</span> JayContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> ContextType<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> useOptionalContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  context<span class="token operator">:</span> JayContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> ContextType <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token keyword">undefined</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> useParentContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>context<span class="token operator">:</span> JayContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> ContextType<span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Example usage:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">interface ComponentContext <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  reactive<span class="token operator">:</span> Reactive<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  mounts<span class="token operator">:</span> MountFunc<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  unmounts<span class="token operator">:</span> MountFunc<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> COMPONENT_CONTEXT <span class="token operator">=</span> createContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ComponentContext<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token function">provideContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>COMPONENT_CONTEXT<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">// ... under some deep call stack</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">let</span> componentContext <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">useContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>COMPONENT_CONTEXT<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Final API</h2>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> interface ContextMarker<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ContextType<span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
