{
  post: {
    title: 'Libraries To Look At',
    content: '<h1>Libraries to look at</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>bling</h2>\n' +
      '<p>interesting approach for file splitting client and server. Worth considering for Jay Components.</p>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://github.com/tanstack/bling">https://github.com/tanstack/bling</a></p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="">import { server$ } from '@tanstack/bling'\n` +
      '\n' +
      'const fetchFn = server$(async (payload) =&gt; {\n' +
      '  // do something\n' +
      "  return 'result'\n" +
      '})</code></pre>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="">import { secret$ } from '@tanstack/bling'\n` +
      '\n' +
      "const secretMessage = secret$('It is a secret!')')</code></pre>\n" +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="">import { import$ } from '@tanstack/bling'\n` +
      '\n' +
      'const fn = await import$(async (name: string) =&gt; {\n' +
      '  return `Hello ${name}`\n' +
      '})</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>React + Redux + Comlink = Off-main-thread</h2>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://dassur.ma/things/react-redux-comlink/">https://dassur.ma/things/react-redux-comlink/</a>\n' +
      '<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Rrv9qFMWNM">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Rrv9qFMWNM</a></p>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Log Methodology Note</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> These design logs are written primarily for AI agents as part of the <a href="/design-log">Design Log methodology</a> and made accessible here for human readers. The language and structure are optimized for machine consumption — expect precise, specification-style prose rather than narrative documentation.</p>\n',
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Libraries To Look At","number":19}'
  }
}
