{
  post: {
    title: 'Building The Compiler',
    content: '<h1>building the code splitting compiler</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Resources:</p>\n' +
      '<h1>Typescript</h1>\n' +
      '<p>how to write a plugin for Typescript compiler, to replace or update code\n' +
      '<a href="https://dev.doctorevidence.com/how-to-write-a-typescript-transform-plugin-fc5308fdd943">How to Write a TypeScript Transform (Plugin)</a></p>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://github.com/itsdouges/awesome-typescript-ecosystem">List of typescript transform resources</a></p>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://github.com/itsdouges/typescript-transformer-handbook">TypeScript Transformer Handbook</a>\n' +
      'how to write a typescript transformer</p>\n' +
      '<p>The handbook is based on the deprecated library <a href="https://github.com/cevek/ttypescript"><code>ttypescript</code></a>.\n' +
      'It points to <a href="https://github.com/nonara/ts-patch">&#39;ts-patch&#39;</a> as a better alternative.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Good example of a simple typescript plugin <a href="https://github.com/longlho/ts-transform-json/blob/master/compile.ts">ts-transform-json</a>.</p>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://blog.logrocket.com/using-typescript-transforms-to-enrich-runtime-code-3fd2863221ed/">Using TypeScript transforms to enrich runtime code</a>\n' +
      'another resource on how to write typescript transformer</p>\n' +
      '<p>Typescript language plugins can be used to provide additional Jay specific messages during Typescript compile time\n' +
      '<a href="https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig#plugins">tsconfig plugins</a>.</p>\n' +
      '<h1>Rust</h1>\n' +
      '<p>Creating typescript from Rust\n' +
      '<a href="https://gist.github.com/ctaggart/1d2f4b9155de35ee78e566784e336dcb">ctaggart/create_source.rs</a></p>\n' +
      '<p>SWC - Rust typescript compiler <a href="https://swc.rs/docs/usage/core">@swc/core</a></p>\n' +
      '<h1>ESBuild - fast bundler in go <a href="https://esbuild.github.io/">esbuild</a></h1>\n' +
      '<p>ESBuild has the <a href="https://esbuild.github.io/plugins/#on-load">on-load</a> plugin callback which can be used to generate files\n' +
      'when loading an imported file. Can be used for generating the Jay files.</p>\n' +
      '<p>ESBuild does not seem to have typescript engine written in go that can used natively. It can use typescript engine in JS.</p>\n' +
      '<h1>Volar.js</h1>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://volarjs.dev/">https://volarjs.dev/</a>\n' +
      'toolset for language services and building custom source files, such as for Vue or Astro.\n' +
      'can be used for the data part of a jay file.</p>\n' +
      '<h1>TS-SQL</h1>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://github.com/codemix/ts-sql/tree/master/src">https://github.com/codemix/ts-sql/tree/master/src</a>\n' +
      'typescript library that uses TS type string matching to parse SQL strings and extract types from.\n' +
      'seems very similar to the data part of a jay file.</p>\n' +
      '<h1>more link</h1>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://github.com/AviVahl/ts-tools">https://github.com/AviVahl/ts-tools</a></p>\n' +
      '<p><a href="https://ts-ast-viewer.com/">https://ts-ast-viewer.com/</a></p>\n' +
      '<h2>The required transformations</h2>\n' +
      '<h1>Function splitting by pattern matching</h1>\n' +
      '<h3>Example 1 - keycode and prevent default example</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> ENTER_KEY <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">13</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>newTodo<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">onkeydown</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>keyCode <span class="token operator">===</span> ENTER_KEY<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    event<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">preventDefault</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">//... rest code</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>to be transformed into\n' +
      'worker:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> ENTER_KEY <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">13</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>newTodo<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">onkeydown</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> keyCode <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>keyCode <span class="token operator">===</span> ENTER_KEY<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">//... rest code</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>main thread:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> ENTER_KEY <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">13</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> funcRepository<span class="token operator">:</span> FunctionsRepository <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">//... rest of function repository functions</span>\n' +
      `  <span class="token string">'3'</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token operator">:</span> JayEvent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>KeyboardEvent<span class="token punctuation">,</span> any<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>keyCode <span class="token operator">===</span> ENTER_KEY<span class="token punctuation">)</span> event<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">preventDefault</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">return</span> event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>keyCode<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Example 2 - input value</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>newTodo<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">oninput</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">setNewTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>target as HTMLInputElement<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>value<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>to be transformed into\n' +
      'worker:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> ENTER_KEY <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">13</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'refs<span class="token punctuation">.</span>newTodo<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">onkeydown</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> value <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">setNewTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>value<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>main thread:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> ENTER_KEY <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">13</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> funcRepository<span class="token operator"'... 9112 more characters,
