{
  post: {
    title: 'Algorithm To Split Safe Code',
    content: '<h1>Code Splitting Algorithm</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>The algorithm aims to enable the splitting of a function into two functions - a <strong>safe</strong> and <strong>unsafe</strong> function based\n' +
      'on configurable patterns.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Given a function</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>keyCode <span class="token operator">===</span> ENTER_KEY<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    event<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">preventDefault</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">let</span> newValue <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">newTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">let</span> val <span class="token operator">=</span> newValue<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">trim</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>val<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token function">setTodos</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token comment">/*... some updated todos */</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      `    <span class="token function">setNewTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">''</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>and given</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>a pattern that allows <code>event.preventDefault</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>given <code>ENTER_KEY</code> is a constant</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>newTodo</code>, <code>setTodos</code> and <code>setNewTodo</code> are state functions considered unsafe code</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>split into</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// safe function, runs in the main thread / window</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>keyCode <span class="token operator">===</span> ENTER_KEY<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    event<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">preventDefault</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> $<span class="token number">0</span><span class="token operator">:</span> event<span class="token punctuation">.</span>keyCode <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// unsafe function, runs in sandbox</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> event<span class="token punctuation">,</span> viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> coordinate <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>$<span class="token number">0</span> <span class="token operator">===</span> ENTER_KEY<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">let</span> newValue <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">newTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">let</span> val <span class="token operator">=</span> newValue<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">trim</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>val<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token function">setTodos</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token comment">/*... some updated todos */</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      `    <span class="token function">setNewTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">''</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This algorithm performs the above function split.</p>\n' +
      '<h1>The algorithm</h1>\n' +
      '<p>We use the notation of</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>Statement</code> - a line of code, or multiple lines as part of a code block <code>{}</code>.</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>Expression</code> - a code fragment that returns a value.</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>The algorithm has the following steps</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Compute <code>Variable</code> assignment chains (access <code>a.b</code>, assignment <code>a = b</code>, compositions <code>={a: b}</code> and decomposition <code>{a: b} = </code>) using <code>NameBindingResolver</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Compute <code>Statement</code>s dependencies based on the above <code>Variable</code>s.</li>\n' +
      '<li>Compute which <code>Statement</code>s are <strong>safe</strong> based on statement dependencies and checking if they are composed of all <strong>safe</strong> <code>Expression</code>s</li>\n' +
      '<li>Splitting the function based on <strong>safe</strong> and <strong>unsafe</strong> <code>Statements</code> and <code>Statement</code> dependencies.</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>Given the above example:</p>\n' +
      '<h2>1. Compute <code>Variable</code>s</h2>\n' +
      '<p><img src="/content/design-log/jay/29-algorithm-to-split-safe-code-1.png" alt="variables" loading="lazy" /></p>\n' +
      '<p>The variables in the code above (in green)</p>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Variable</th>\n' +
      '<th>path</th>\n' +
      '<th>root</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>ENTER_KEY</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>[]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>AST-constant</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>event</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>[&#39;event&#39;]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>AST-params[0]</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>viewState</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>[&#39;viewState&#39;]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>AST-params[0]</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>coordinate</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>[&#39;coordinate&#39;]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>AST-params[0]</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>newValue</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>[]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>AST-function-call</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>val</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>[]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td><code>AST-function-call</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<p>In blue are property access chains using those variables,\n' +
      'which are then used to compute the source value for each variable, dependencies and pattern matching</p>\n' +
      '<p>Note that variables do not analyze the actual AST - given a function call or a trinary operator,\n' +
      'the connection between the parts is kept modelled as the AST root. Such analysis is done below at the <code>isSafe</code> function.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>The NameBindingResolver</h3>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>NameBindingResolver</code> is a utility to calculate the origins of <code>Identifier</code> into <code>Variables</code> given property access,\n' +
      'assignment, deconstruction, etc.</p>\n' +
      '<p>The basic element is the <code>Variable</code> which explains an <code>Identifier</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> interface Variable <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  name<span class="token operator">?:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// optional variable name - an identifier</span>\n' +
      '  accessedFrom<span class="token operator">?:</span> Variable<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// the variable it was accessed from using property access</span>\n' +
      '  accessedByProperty<span class="token operator">?:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// the property used for the access</span>\n' +
      '  assignedFrom<span class="token operator">?:</span> Variable<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// another variable it was assigned from using a=b</span>\n' +
      '  root<span class="token operator">?:</span> VariableRoot<span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// the root node in the TS AST that is the root of the access chain</span>\n' +
      '  properties'... 17191 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Algorithm To Split Safe Code","number":29}'
  }
}
