{
  post: {
    title: 'Jay Context API',
    content: '<h1>Jay Content API</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Context API solves two concerns with other frameworks -</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><em>Dependency Injection</em> - inject an object to a sub-component without having all the parent components hand it over\n' +
      'explicitly, what is also called <code>property drilling</code>.</li>\n' +
      '<li><em>Update component on change</em> - when the context value changes, all component who are using it are updated.</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>With Jay, we also add a 3rd requirement for the context API: 3. <em>Explicit Declaration</em> - The consumption of the context has to be explicit in the consuming component.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Low level API vs High Level API</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The Runtime package exposes a low level context API based on</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">interface ContextType <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">/*context members*/</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> CONTEXT_SYMBOL <span class="token operator">=</span> createContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>ComponentContext<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token function">provideContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  CONTEXT_SYMBOL<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">/*context members*/</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">// ... under some deep call stack</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">let</span> theContext <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">useContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>CONTEXT_SYMBOL<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This low level API only solves the first requirement of <em>dependency injection</em>, but not the other two.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>High Level Context API</h2>\n' +
      '<p>To meet the 3rd requirement, <em>Explicit Declaration</em>, we suggest to extend the Jay Component <code>Props&lt;&gt;</code> model such that\n' +
      'given a <code>Prop key</code> that is a <code>Symbol</code>, it is not turned into a getter. The component model will inject contexts to props\n' +
      'based on those Symbols.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Not turning context into a getter has two advantages - allowing deconstructing, and implying the context itself is not\n' +
      'updated.</p>\n' +
      '<p>To meet the 2nd requirement, we make the context reactive such that a component can follow Signals of the context.\n' +
      'This implies that we have a constructor callback to create the context reactive. Another option is to create a reactive,\n' +
      'and use it as the ContextItself.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>The proposed high level Context API:</h3>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> TodoComponent <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./todo'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      'interface TodoContext <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  todos<span class="token operator">:</span> Getter<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>Array<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>TodoItem<span class="token operator">&gt;&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">updateTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>newItem<span class="token operator">:</span> TodoItem<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">removeTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>item<span class="token operator">:</span> TodoItem<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">newTodo</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>newItem<span class="token operator">:</span> TodoItem<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> TODO_CONTEXT <span class="token operator">=</span> createContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>TodoContext<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// provide context</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> todoContext <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">reactive</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>todos<span class="token punctuation">,</span> setTodos<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createState</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token comment">/* initial value*/</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> updateTodo <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>newItem<span class="token operator">:</span> TodoItem<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">/*...*/</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token function">setTodos</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token comment">/*...*/</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> removeTodo <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>item<span class="token operator">:</span> TodoItem<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">/*...*/</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token function">setTodos</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token comment">/*...*/</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> newTodo <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>newItem<span class="token operator">:</span> TodoItem<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">/*...*/</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token function">setTodos</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token comment">/*...*/</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
