{
  post: {
    title: 'Rename CreateState To CreateSignal',
    content: '<h1>Rename createState to createSignal</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Why?</p>\n' +
      '<p>Because <code>useState</code> is the React style, not reactive state management, while <code>createSignal</code> is the solid.js reactive.\n' +
      'Jay is using the latter, and therefore we should call the thingy by the accepted name, <code>createSignal</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Log Methodology Note</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> These design logs are written primarily for AI agents as part of the <a href="/design-log">Design Log methodology</a> and made accessible here for human readers. The language and structure are optimized for machine consumption — expect precise, specification-style prose rather than narrative documentation.</p>\n',
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Rename CreateState To CreateSignal","number":31}'
  }
}
