{
  post: {
    title: 'Jay 4 React',
    content: '<h1>Jay 4 React</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Jay 4 React is intended to provide a bridge between Jay and the existing React ecosystem. The core principle is to\n' +
      'continue and support Jay unique advantages (design 2 code and secure 3rd party components) while enabling to\n' +
      'work as part of a larger React application.</p>\n' +
      '<p>This leads to the following principles:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Write the components in Jay.</li>\n' +
      '<li>Use Jay component from React using the adapter function <code>jay2React</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Jay compiler to generate regular React components.</li>\n' +
      '<li>Anything that goes into the sandbox is running regular Jay.</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p><strong>The end result is that a Jay component can be used as a React component,\n' +
      'and can use React components as child components.</strong></p>\n' +
      '<h2>jay2React</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>jay2React</code> function accepts a Jay Component and returns a React Component.</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> ReactCart <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">jay2React</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>Cart<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>At which</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>Cart</code> is the Jay Component</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>ReactCart</code> is the React Component</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>In terms of signature it handles the types mapping including mapping Jay props to React props and\n' +
      'mapping Jay event handlers to React callback props.</p>\n' +
      '<p>In terms of implementation, it relays on the compiler to transform the Jay Component and Jay Element.\n' +
      'The React Component <code>makeJayComponent</code> is replaced with <code>makeJay2ReactComponent</code> making the Jay component into\n' +
      'a higher level react component, accepting the element as a react component.\n' +
      'The Jay Element is generated as a React Component.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>The generations / transformations</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Jay 4 React adds a new generation target to Jay compiler - target = react, which includes</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>generating <code>jay-html</code> files as React components</li>\n' +
      '<li>transforming Jay components into higher level React components</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Example</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Consider the counter component - sources in Jay -</p>\n' +
      '<h3>The Jay HTML file</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Source</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/yaml-jay&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '              data:\n' +
      '      count: number\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;subtracter&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>-<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="token attribute">style</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;margin: 0 16px&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{count}<span class="token tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="token attribute">ref</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;adder-button&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>+<span class="token tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The generated React code for the element is</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript jsx">import { HTMLElementProxy } from 'jay-runtime';\n` +
      "import { Jay4ReactElementProps, eventsFor } from 'jay-4-react';\n" +
      "import { ReactElement } from 'react';\n" +
      '\n' +
      'export interface CounterViewState {\n' +
      '    count: number;\n' +
      '}\n' +
      '\n' +
      'export interface CounterElementRefs {\n' +
      '    subtracter: HTMLElementProxy&lt;CounterViewState, HTMLButtonElement&gt;;\n' +
      '    adderButton: HTMLElementProxy&lt;CounterViewState, HTMLButtonElement&gt;;\n' +
      '}\n' +
      '\n' +
      'export interface CounterElementProps extends Jay4ReactElementProps&lt;CounterViewState&gt; {}\n' +
      '\n' +
      'export function render({\n' +
      '    vs,\n' +
      '    context,\n' +
      '}: CounterElementProps): ReactElement&lt;CounterElementProps, any&gt; {\n' +
      '    return (\n' +
      '        &lt;div&gt;\n' +
      "            &lt;button {...eventsFor(context, 'subtracter')}&gt;-&lt;/button&gt;\n" +
      "            &lt;span style={{ margin: '0 16px' }}&gt;{vs.count}&lt;/span&gt;\n" +
      "            &lt;button {...eventsFor(context, 'adderButton')}&gt;+&lt;/button&gt;\n" +
      '        &lt;/div&gt;\n' +
      '    );\n' +
      '}</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>However, the <code>.d.ts</code> of the element remains the same as regular Jay to enable writing the component as with regular Jay.</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> JayElement<span class="token punctuation">,</span> RenderElement<span class="token punctuation">,</span> HTMLElementProxy<span class="token punctuation">,</span> RenderElementOptions <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterViewState <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  count<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterElementRefs <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  subtracter<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElementProxy<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>CounterViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> HTMLButtonElement<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  adderButton<span class="token operator">:</span> HTMLElementProxy<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>CounterViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> HTMLButtonElement<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> type CounterElement <span class="token operator">=</span> JayElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>CounterViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> CounterElementRefs<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> type CounterElementRender <span class="token operator">=</span> RenderElement<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>\n' +
      '  CounterViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  CounterElementRefs<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  CounterElement\n' +
      '<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> type CounterElementPreRender <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>CounterElementRefs<span class="token punctuation">,</span> CounterElementRender<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> declare <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">render</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>options<span class="token operator">?:</span> RenderElementOptions<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> CounterElementPreRender<span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>the component file</h2>\n' +
      '<p>source</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> CounterElementRefs<span class="token punctuation">,</span> render <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./generated-react-element'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> createEvent<span class="token punctuation">,</span> createSignal<span class="token punctuation">,</span> makeJayComponent<span class="token punctuation">,</span> Props <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'jay-component'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface CounterProps <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  initialValue<span class="token operator">:</span> number<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
