      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This option has the same issue as <a href="34-2-jay-stack-hooks-style-api-option">34 - 2 - jay stack - hooks style API option.md</a>\n' +
