{
  post: {
    title: 'Changing Jay-Html Format',
    content: '<h1>Changing Jay HTML import format</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>First, why do we need to change the import format?\n' +
      'With the introduction of plugins, we have two different ways to import components - as a headfull component\n' +
      'and as a headless component.</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Headless component - includes a Contract file <code>YAML</code>, and a component <code>ts</code> file.</li>\n' +
      '<li>Headfull component - includes a Design file <code>jay-html</code>, and a component <code>ts</code> file.</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>Before the change, the syntax for importing a headfull component is</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;link</span> <span class="token attribute">rel</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;import&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">href</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;./item&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">names</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;Item&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>and the syntax for importing a headless component (suggested in <a href="39-plugin-package">39 - Plugin package.md</a>) is</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">src</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;stores/product-page&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">name</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;page&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">key</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;productPage&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>and we remind that <code>jay-html</code> also has the data script defined as</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-yaml&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  data:\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Suggested change</h2>\n' +
      '<p>We want to transform all of the above into <code>script</code> tags with appropriate type</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">src</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;stores/product-page&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">name</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;page&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">key</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;productPage&quot;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headfull&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">src</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;./item&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">names</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;Item&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-data&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  data:\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>final change</h2>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;../named-counter/named-counter.jay-contract&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">src</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;../named-counter/named-counter&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">name</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;namedCounter&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">key</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;namedCounter&quot;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headfull&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">src</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;./item&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">names</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;Item&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-data&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  data:\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The <code>application-jay-headless</code> import format includes</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>contract</code> - the location of the contract to import, which means importing the contract <code>ViewState</code> and <code>Refs</code> types.</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>key</code> - the attribute name under which both the headless component <code>ViewState</code> and <code>Refs</code> are nested\n' +
      'at the current component <code>ViewState</code> and <code>Refs</code>.</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>src</code> - the location of the implementation of the contract.</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>name</code> - the name of the <code>const</code> exported from the <code>src</code> module as the component definition.</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>Note: At this point we leave two deferred things to fix later -</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>By importing the <code>src</code> module, we can derive the <code>contract</code> automatically using typescript AST and explicit\n' +
      'definition of component usage of a contract file.</li>\n' +
      '<li>The <code>jay-html</code> compilation for jay is ignoring the <code>jay-headless</code> imports for now.\n' +
      'It is only used by <code>jay-stack</code> compilation of a page. Worth revisiting later for supporting\n' +
      'composite components as part of <code>jay</code> and not only <code>jay-stack</code>.</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Log Methodology Note</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> These design logs are written primarily for AI agents as part of the <a href="/design-log">Design Log methodology</a> and made accessible here for human readers. The language and structure are optimized for machine consumption — expect precise, specification-style prose rather than narrative documentation.</p>\n',
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Changing Jay-Html Format","number":40}'
  }
}
