  post: {
    title: 'Package Naming Migration To @Jay-Framework',
    content: '<h1>Package Naming Migration to @jay-framework</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Overview</h2>\n' +
      '<p>All package names have been migrated from <code>jay-something</code> to <code>@jay-framework/something</code> in preparation for open source release and to align with the planned NPM and GitHub organization names.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Motivation</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Open Source Preparation</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>NPM Organization</strong>: The packages will be published under the <code>@jay-framework</code> NPM organization</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>GitHub Organization</strong>: The repository will be moved to the <code>jay-framework</code> GitHub organization</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Consistency</strong>: All package names now follow the scoped package naming convention</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Benefits</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Professional Branding</strong>: Scoped packages provide better organization and branding</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Namespace Protection</strong>: Prevents naming conflicts with other packages</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Clear Ownership</strong>: Makes it clear these packages belong to the Jay Framework project</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Future Scalability</strong>: Easier to add new packages under the same scope</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Changes Made</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Package Name Mapping</h3>\n' +
      '<h4>Compiler Packages</h4>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-compiler</code> → <code>@jay-framework/compiler</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-compiler-jay-html</code> → <code>@jay-framework/compiler-jay-html</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-compiler-analyze-exported-types</code> → <code>@jay-framework/compiler-analyze-exported-types</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-compiler-shared</code> → <code>@jay-framework/compiler-shared</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-cli</code> → <code>@jay-framework/jay-cli</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-rollup-plugin</code> → <code>@jay-framework/rollup-plugin</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-vite-plugin</code> → <code>@jay-framework/vite-plugin</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Runtime Packages</h4>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-component</code> → <code>@jay-framework/component</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-runtime</code> → <code>@jay-framework/runtime</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-json-patch</code> → <code>@jay-framework/json-patch</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-secure</code> → <code>@jay-framework/secure</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-serialization</code> → <code>@jay-framework/serialization</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-list-compare</code> → <code>@jay-framework/list-compare</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-reactive</code> → <code>@jay-framework/reactive</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-4-react</code> → <code>@jay-framework/4-react</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Jay Stack Packages</h4>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-dev-server</code> → <code>@jay-framework/dev-server</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-fullstack-component</code> → <code>@jay-framework/fullstack-component</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack-server-runtime</code> → <code>@jay-framework/stack-server-runtime</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack-cli</code> → <code>@jay-framework/stack-cli</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack-client-runtime</code> → <code>@jay-framework/stack-client-runtime</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack-route-scanner</code> → <code>@jay-framework/stack-route-scanner</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Other Packages</h4>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-dev-environment</code> → <code>@jay-framework/dev-environment</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-mutable</code> → <code>@jay-framework-deprecated/mutable</code> (deprecated)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Files Updated</h3>\n' +
      '<h4>Configuration Files</h4>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>840 files</strong> modified across the entire codebase</li>\n' +
      '<li>All <code>package.json</code> files updated with new package names and dependencies</li>\n' +
      '<li>All <code>vite.config.ts</code> files updated with new external rollupOptions</li>\n' +
      '<li>All <code>tsconfig.json</code> files updated with new path mappings</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Documentation Files</h4>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>43 documentation files</strong> updated</li>\n' +
      '<li>All README.md files across packages and examples</li>\n' +
      '<li>All documentation in <code>docs/</code> directory</li>\n' +
      '<li>All design log entries</li>\n' +
      '<li>All example project documentation</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Code Files</h4>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>All import statements updated throughout the codebase</li>\n' +
      '<li>All TypeScript/JavaScript files with package references</li>\n' +
      '<li>All build artifacts and generated files</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Impact</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Breaking Changes</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Internal Dependencies</strong>: All internal package dependencies updated</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Import Statements</strong>: All import statements need to use new package names</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Build Configuration</strong>: All build tools need to reference new package names</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Migration Path</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Workspace Update</strong>: Run <code>yarn install</code> to update workspace dependencies</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Build Verification</strong>: Run <code>yarn build</code> to ensure everything builds correctly</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Test Execution</strong>: Run <code>yarn test</code> to verify functionality</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Documentation Review</strong>: Verify all documentation reflects new package names</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Log Methodology Note</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> These design logs are written primarily for AI agents as part of the <a href="/design-log">Design Log methodology</a> and made accessible here for human readers. The language and structure are optimized for machine consumption — expect precise, specification-style prose rather than narrative documentation.</p>\n',
