  post: {
    title: 'Css Support',
    content: '<h1>CSS support</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>When a jay-html file contains CSS (either via <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> tags or inline <code>&lt;style&gt;</code>), the compiler will extract the CSS and replace it with a CSS import based on the jay-html filename.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Process</h2>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Extraction</strong>: CSS content from <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> tags is extracted from the jay-html file</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Replacement</strong>: CSS references are replaced with a single CSS import using the pattern <code>[filename].css</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>File generation</strong>: Extracted CSS is written to a corresponding <code>.css</code> file</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Vite integration</strong>: The vite plugin uses Vite&#39;s built-in CSS handling to bundle and serve the CSS files</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Example</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Input jay-html file (<code>counter.jay-html</code>):</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;link</span> <span class="token attribute">rel</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">href</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;styles.css&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;style</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  .counter {\n' +
      '    color: blue;\n' +
      '  }\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/style</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;counter&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>...<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Output jay-html file:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;link</span> <span class="token attribute">rel</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">href</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;counter.css&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;counter&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>...<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Generated CSS file (<code>counter.css</code>):</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-css"><span class="token comment">/* content from styles.css */</span>\n' +
      '.counter <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  color<span class="token punctuation">:</span> blue<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This approach leverages Vite&#39;s existing CSS pipeline while maintaining the declarative nature of jay-html files.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Vite Plugin Implementation</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The vite plugin will handle CSS extraction and virtual file creation to ensure proper CSS serving during development\n' +
      '(simplified example for clarity):</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-javascript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">jayHtmlPlugin</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `    name<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'jay-html-transform'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">async</span> <span class="token function">transform</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>code<span class="token punctuation">,</span> id<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `      <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>id<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">endsWith</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'.jay-html'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n` +
      '        <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> css<span class="token punctuation">,</span> html <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">parseJayHtml</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>code<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '        <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>css<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '          <span class="token comment">// Create a virtual CSS file that Vite can process</span>\n' +
      '          <span class="token keyword">const</span> cssId <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token string">`${id}.css`</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      `          <span class="token comment">// Register the CSS with Vite's module graph</span>\n` +
      '          <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">addWatchFile</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>id<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// Watch the original file</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '          <span class="token comment">// Let Vite handle the CSS processing and HMR</span>\n' +
      '          <span class="token keyword">const</span> cssModule <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">await</span> <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">resolve</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>cssId<span class="token punctuation">,</span> id<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '          <span class="token keyword">return</span> `\n' +
      '            <span class="token keyword">import</span> &quot;$<span class="token punctuation">{</span>cssId<span class="token punctuation">}</span>&quot;<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '            $<span class="token punctuation">{</span>html<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '          `<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '        <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '        <span class="token keyword">return</span> html<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '      <span class="token comment">// Handle virtual CSS files</span>\n' +
      `      <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>id<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">endsWith</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>'<span class="token punctuation">.</span>jay<span class="token operator">-</span>html<span class="token punctuation">.</span>css<span class="token string">')) {\n` +
      `        const originalId = id.replace('</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>css<span class="token string">', '</span>'<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '        <span class="token keyword">const</span> originalCode <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">await</span> <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">load</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> id<span class="token operator">:</span> originalId <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '        <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> css <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">parseJayHtml</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>originalCode<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '        <span class="token keyword">return</span> css<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This implementation ensures that:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>CSS is properly extracted and served by Vite&#39;s dev server</li>\n' +
      '<li>Hot Module Replacement (HMR) works for both HTML and CSS changes</li>\n' +
      '<li>The virtual CSS files are processed through Vite&#39;s CSS pipeline</li>\n' +
      '<li>CSS imports are automatically injected into the transformed HTML</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Log Methodology Note</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Note:</strong> These design logs are written primarily for AI agents as part of the <a href="/design-log">Design Log methodology</a> and made accessible here for human readers. The language and structure are optimized for machine consumption — expect precise, specification-style prose rather than narrative documentation.</p>\n',
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Css Support","number":44}'
  }
}
