{
  post: {
    title: 'View State Types',
    content: '<h1>View State Types</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>The Jay type system, represented internally as <code>JayType</code> in\n' +
      '<a href="..%2Fpackages%2Fcompiler%2Fcompiler-shared%2Flib%2Fjay-type.ts">jay-type.ts</a> describes the type system\n' +
      'used to represent the <code>Data</code> and <code>Variant</code> parts of a contract.</p>\n' +
      '<p>The current supported types are</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>string</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>number</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>boolean</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>Date</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>enum</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>object</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>array</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Adding Types</h2>\n' +
      '<p>To have full support for a type system, we need to extend the type system with additional types</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>Promise&lt;JayType&gt;</code> - allows a component to render a promise, which is a variant of pending and ready.</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>Currency</code> - which is a pair of currency symbol and amount</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>DateWithTimezone</code> - date with a specific timezone to be rendered at</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Promise of Objects and Arrays</h2>\n' +
      '<p>For complex types like objects and arrays, the <code>async variant of &lt;type&gt;</code> syntax becomes unwieldy. Instead, we use an <code>async: true</code> property on the tag itself to indicate that the nested structure is asynchronous.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Object Promise</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token comment"># Instead of: async variant of UserProfile</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> userProfile\n' +
      '  type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '  async<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '  tags<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> name\n' +
      '      type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '      dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> email\n' +
      '      type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '      dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> preferences\n' +
      '      type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '      async<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '      tags<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '        <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> theme\n' +
      '          type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '          dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '        <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> language\n' +
      '          type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '          dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Array Promise</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token comment"># Instead of: async variant of Notification[]</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> notifications\n' +
      '  type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '  async<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '  repeated<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '  tags<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> id\n' +
      '      type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '      dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> message\n' +
      '      type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '      dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> timestamp\n' +
      '      type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '      dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> date</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Mixed Promise Types</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token keyword">tags</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> userProfile\n' +
      '    type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '    async<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '    tags<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> name\n' +
      '        type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '        dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '      <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> email\n' +
      '        type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '        dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> settings\n' +
      '    type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '    async<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '    tags<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> theme\n' +
      '        type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '        dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '      <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> language\n' +
      '        type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '        dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> notifications\n' +
      '    type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '    async<span class="token punctuation">:</span> true\n' +
      '    tags<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> item\n' +
      '        type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '        tags<span class="token punctuation">:</span>\n' +
      '          <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> id\n' +
      '            type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '            dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '          <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> message\n' +
      '            type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '            dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> string\n' +
      '          <span class="token punctuation">-</span> tag<span class="token punctuation">:</span> timestamp\n' +
      '            type<span class="token punctuation">:</span> data\n' +
      '            dataType<span class="token punctuation">:</span> date</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This approach maintains the YAML structure while clearly indicating which tags are asynchronous, making contracts more readable and maintainable. The <code>async: true</code> property is a simple boolean flag that can be applied to any tag that has nested structure.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Timezone</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Another challenge is that in Javascript, on the Browser, a <code>Date</code> object is always rendered at the browser local timezone\n' +
      'unless otherwise specified in date formatting. But there are cases when we want to render a date in a specific timezone,\n' +
      'other then the browser. For those cases, the timezone itself is a parameter.</p>\n' +
      '<p>For simplicity, we suggest creating a new type that id a pair of a Date and Timezone, such as</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">type DateWithTimezone <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  date<span class="token operator">:</span> Date<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  locales<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// the locals to use when formatting the date above</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>local</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The best practice with Web Applications and Websites is to use the client browser local to select from site available\n' +
      'locals. Jay offers per local rendering, given a list of locals to support for a site. All the formatting below\n' +
      'assumes the local was determined beforehand and is used with the formatting objects.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Formatting</h2>\n' +
      '<p>We also need to add formatting support into the Jay-HTML files. We map our types to formatting support as</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>Date</code> --&gt; <code>Intl.DateTimeFormat</code>, using the local timezone</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>DateWithTimezone</code> --&gt; <code>Intl.DateTimeFormat</code>, using the provided timezone</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>Number</code> --&gt; <code>Intl.NumberFormat</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>Currency</code> --&gt; <code>Intl.NumberFormat</code>, with style <code>currency</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Jay-HTML and contract support</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The new types are added to the jay-html type system, such that full typesystem in Jay HTML is extended\n' +
      'to be</p>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>name in Jay HTML or Contract</th>\n' +
      '<th>jay type</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td>string</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayString</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>number</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayNumber</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>boolean</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayBoolean</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>date</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayDate</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>zoned-date</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayZonedDate</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>currency</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayCurrency</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>async variant of &lt;type&gt;</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayPromise&lt;JayType&gt;</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>async &lt;type&gt; (shorthand)</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>JayPromise&lt;JayType&gt;</code></td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<h2>update on async</h2>\n' +
      '<p>to better support both objects and arrays in <code>jay-html</code>, we changed the syntax to include the word <code>async</code> as part\n' +
      'of the propert'... 3344 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"View State Types","number":45}'
  }
}
