[Build] 126/1235 /design-log/jay/[slug] (slug=50-rendering-phases-in-contracts)
{
  post: {
    title: 'Jay-Html With Contract References',
    content: '<h1>Jay HTML with Contract References</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Design Log #50 successfully implemented rendering phases in <code>.jay-contract</code> files, enabling compile-time type validation for slow, fast, and interactive rendering phases. However, <code>.jay-html</code> files still embed their data structure directly in the HTML, which has two limitations:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>No phase annotations</strong>: Can&#39;t specify which properties belong to which rendering phase</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Limited reusability</strong>: Data structure can&#39;t be shared between multiple HTML templates</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem Statement</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Consider this <code>.jay-html</code> file:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-data&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      data:\n' +
      '        slowlyRendered: string\n' +
      '        fastRendered: string\n' +
      '        fastDynamicRendered: string\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{slowlyRendered}<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{fastDynamicRendered}<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Current Issues:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>No phase information</strong>: The embedded data structure has no way to indicate which properties are slow vs fast</li>\n' +
      `<li><strong>Manual type definitions</strong>: Developers must manually define phase-specific types:<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">type SlowlyViewState <span class="token operator">=</span> Pick<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'slowlyRendered'</span><span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      'type FastViewState <span class="token operator">=</span> Omit<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> keyof SlowlyViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>No type safety</strong>: Manual types can diverge from actual usage, no compile-time validation</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>No generated contract type</strong>: Can&#39;t use <code>makeJayStackComponent&lt;PageContract&gt;()</code> with phase-aware types</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Example from real codebase:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<p>File: <code>/Users/yoav/work/jay/jay/packages/jay-stack/stack-server-runtime/test/simple-page/page.ts</code></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// Manual type definitions (error-prone, not validated)</span>\n' +
      `type SlowlyViewState <span class="token operator">=</span> Pick<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'slowlyRendered'</span><span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      'type FastViewState <span class="token operator">=</span> Omit<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> keyof SlowlyViewState<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      `<span class="token comment">// Line 1 tries to import PageContract, but it doesn't include phase types</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> render<span class="token punctuation">,</span> PageElementRefs<span class="token punctuation">,</span> PageViewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> PageContract <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> '<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token operator">/</span>compiled<span class="token operator">/</span>page<span class="token punctuation">.</span>jay<span class="token operator">-</span>html'<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// Line 65 uses PageContract, but it has no phase-specific ViewState types</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> page <span class="token operator">=</span> makeJayStackComponent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageContract<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span>withProps<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageProps<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withSlowlyRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>renderSlowlyChanging<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token comment">// No type validation!</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withFastRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>renderFastChanging<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// No type validation!</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Proposed Solution: Contract References</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Allow <code>.jay-html</code> files to <strong>reference an external <code>.jay-contract</code> file</strong> for their data structure definition instead of embedding it inline.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Core Design Principles</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Separation of Concerns</strong>:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>.jay-contract</code> = Data structure + phase annotations (what to render)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>.jay-html</code> = Template + rendering logic (how to render)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Single Source of Truth</strong>: Contract defines the data structure once, HTML implements it</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Backward Compatibility</strong>: Existing inline data structures continue to work</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Contract Reusability</strong>: Multiple HTML templates can reference the same contract</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Type Safety</strong>: Phase-specific types automatically generated from contract</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Syntax: Contract Reference in Jay HTML</h3>\n' +
      '<h4>Option A: Reference in <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> tag (Recommended)</h4>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- Reference external contract file --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-data&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;./page.jay-contract&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{slowlyRendered}<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>{fastDynamicRendered}<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;/body</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Minimal syntax change</li>\n' +
      '<li>Uses existing <code>&lt;script type=&quot;application/jay-data&quot;&gt;</code> tag</li>\n' +
      '<li>Empty script body clearly indicates &quot;defined elsewhere&quot;</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>contract</code> attribute is explicit and discoverable</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Script tag is empty (might be confusing initially)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h4>Option B: Import-style reference at top</h4>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;html</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;head</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;jay-import</span> <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;./page.jay-contract&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '    <span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-data&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token comment">&lt;!-- Data structure defined in refere'... 129339 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Jay-Html With Contract References","number":51}'
  }
}
