{
  post: {
    title: 'Project Structure Identification - Pages Vs Components',
    content: '<h1>Project Structure Identification: Pages vs Components</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Date:</strong> December 1, 2025<br><strong>Status:</strong> Design Proposal - Enhanced with Component URLs<br><strong>Related:</strong> Editor Protocol, ProjectInfo API</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Summary</h2>\n' +
      '<p>This document proposes enhancing the <code>ProjectComponent</code> interface to achieve perfect symmetry with <code>ProjectPage</code>. The key insight is that both pages and components are <strong>contract roots</strong> that should be identified by URL-like paths. The enhanced proposal adds support for <strong>dynamic segments</strong> in component paths (e.g., <code>/components/clock/[initialTime]</code>) that map to component props, creating a powerful and consistent organizational pattern.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>The Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The current <code>ProjectInfo</code> structure in the editor protocol treats pages and components asymmetrically in terms of identification:</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Current Implementation</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// packages/jay-stack/editor-protocol/lib/protocol.ts</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface ProjectInfo <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    name<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    localPath<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    pages<span class="token operator">:</span> ProjectPage<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    components<span class="token operator">:</span> ProjectComponent<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    installedApps<span class="token operator">:</span> InstalledApp<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    installedAppContracts<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '        <span class="token punctuation">[</span>appName<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token operator">:</span> InstalledAppContracts<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface ProjectPage <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    name<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>           <span class="token comment">// Directory name</span>\n' +
      '    url<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>            <span class="token comment">// ✅ UNIQUE identifier (e.g., &quot;/&quot;, &quot;/products/:id&quot;)</span>\n' +
      '    filePath<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>       <span class="token comment">// Path to page.jay-html</span>\n' +
      '    contractSchema<span class="token operator">?:</span> ContractSchema<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    usedComponents<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface ProjectComponent <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    name<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>           <span class="token comment">// ❌ Just filename - NOT unique</span>\n' +
      '    filePath<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>       <span class="token comment">// Path to component file</span>\n' +
      '    contractPath<span class="token operator">?:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">;</span>  <span class="token comment">// Path to contract file</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>The Asymmetry</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Pages:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Have a unique identifier: <code>url</code> field</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ URL provides natural path-based identification</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Clear &quot;address&quot; that can be used to reference pages</li>\n' +
      '<li>Example: <code>/products/[slug]</code> uniquely identifies a page</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Components:</strong></p>\n' +
