      '<li>❌ Only have a <code>name</code> field (just the filename)</li>\n' +
      '<li>❌ No unique path-based identifier</li>\n' +
      '<li>❌ Cannot organize in subdirectories without collisions</li>\n' +
      '<li>Example: <code>submit-button</code> could collide with another <code>submit-button</code> in a different folder</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Why This Matters</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>1. Both Are Contract Roots</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Pages and components are conceptually similar - both are <strong>root Jay elements</strong> that define contracts:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Pages</strong>: Entry points accessible via URLs</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Components</strong>: Reusable elements accessible via import paths</li>\n' +
