{
  post: {
    title: 'Jay-Stack Client-Server Code Splitting',
    content: '<h1>Jay Stack Client-Server Code Splitting</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>From Design Log #34 (Jay Stack) and #50 (Rendering Phases), we have established that Jay Stack components have three rendering phases:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Slowly changing (server-only)</strong>: Build-time/request-time static data rendering</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Fast changing (server-only)</strong>: Request-time dynamic data rendering</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Interactive (client-only)</strong>: Client-side interactivity and state management</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>The builder API for Jay Stack components intentionally mixes client and server concerns in a single component definition:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> categoryPage <span class="token operator">=</span> makeJayStackComponent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>CategoryPageContract<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span>withProps<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageProps<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withServices</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>WIX_STORES_SERVICE_MARKER<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token comment">// Server-only</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withLoadParams</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>loadCategoryParams<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token comment">// Server-only</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withSlowlyRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>renderSlowlyChanging<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token comment">// Server-only</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withFastRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>renderFastChanging<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token comment">// Server-only</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withInteractive</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>CategoryPageInteractive<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// Client-only</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This unified API provides excellent developer experience - all component logic in one place with full type safety. However, it creates a <strong>critical build-time challenge</strong>.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem Statement</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Currently, the full component definition (including all server and client code) is imported by both environments:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Server bundle</strong>: Imports the full component, runs server methods (<code>withServices</code>, <code>withLoadParams</code>, <code>withSlowlyRender</code>, <code>withFastRender</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Client bundle</strong>: Imports the full component to access <code>withInteractive</code>, <code>withContexts</code></li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>This causes several problems:</p>\n' +
      '<h3>1. Bundle Bloat</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Client bundles</strong> include all server code (database logic, service implementations, server-only imports)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Server bundles</strong> include client-only code (interactive handlers, browser APIs)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>2. Security Risks</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Server secrets, API keys, database queries could leak to client bundle</li>\n' +
      '<li>Server-only dependencies expose unnecessary attack surface</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>3. Build Failures (Critical Issue!)</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Client builds</strong>: Server-only Node.js imports (e.g., <code>node:fs</code>, <code>node:crypto</code>) fail in browser builds</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Server builds</strong>: Client-only browser APIs (e.g., <code>document</code>, <code>window</code>, <code>addEventListener</code>) crash Node.js ❌</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>SSR</strong>: Server tries to execute <code>withInteractive</code> code that calls <code>document.getElementById()</code> → Runtime error</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>4. Type Safety Gaps</h3>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>No compile-time guarantee that server code stays on server</li>\n' +
      '<li>No compile-time guarantee that client code doesn&#39;t use browser APIs on server</li>\n' +
      '<li>No way to verify client bundle doesn&#39;t include server secrets</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Current Implementation Analysis</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>How Client Scripts Are Generated</h3>\n' +
      '<p>From <code>packages/jay-stack/stack-server-runtime/lib/generate-client-script.ts</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">generateClientScript</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  defaultViewState<span class="token operator">:</span> object<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  fastCarryForward<span class="token operator">:</span> object<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  parts<span class="token operator">:</span> DevServerPagePart<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  jayHtmlPath<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `  <span class="token keyword">const</span> imports <span class="token operator">=</span> parts<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">map</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>part<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> part<span class="token punctuation">.</span>clientImport<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">join</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'\\n'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> compositeParts <span class="token operator">=</span> parts<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">map</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>part<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> part<span class="token punctuation">.</span>clientPart<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token string">`&lt;!doctype html&gt;\n' +
      '    &lt;script type=&quot;module&quot;&gt;\n' +
      '      import {makeCompositeJayComponent} from &quot;@jay-framework/stack-client-runtime&quot;;\n' +
      "      import { render } from '${jayHtmlPath}';\n" +
      '      ${imports}  // ⚠️ Imports full component definitions\n' +
      '      \n' +
      '      const pageComp = makeCompositeJayComponent(render, viewState, fastCarryForward, ${compositeParts})\n' +
      '    &lt;/script&gt;`</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>From <code>packages/jay-stack/stack-server-runtime/lib/load-page-parts.ts</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">const</span> pageComponent <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">await</span> vite<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">ssrLoadModule</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>route<span class="token punctuation">.</span>compPath<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>page<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'parts<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">push</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  compDefinition<span class="token operator">:</span> pageComponent<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  clientImport<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">`import {page} from \'${route.compPath}\'`</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token comment">// ⚠️ Full import</span>\n' +
      '  clientPart<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">`{comp: page.comp, contextMarkers: []}`</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token comment">// ⚠️ Accesses .comp which has all code</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The problem: <code>page.comp</code> contains the client-side component constructor, but to access it, we import the entire <code>page</code> object which includes all the server-side methods.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Current Builder Structure</h3>\n' +
      '<p>From <code>packages/jay-stack/full-stack-component/lib/jay-stack-builder.ts</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">class</span> BuilderImplementation<span class="token operator">&lt;</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    services<span class="token operator">:</span> Services <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span> as any<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    contexts<span class="token operator">:</span> Contexts <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span> as any<sp'... 196302 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Jay-Stack Client-Server Code Splitting","number":52}'
  }
}
