{
  post: {
    title: 'Plugin System Refinement And Dynamic Contracts',
    content: '<h1>Plugin System Refinement and Dynamic Contracts</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Date:</strong> December 11, 2025<br><strong>Status:</strong> ✅ Implemented<br><strong>Implementation Date:</strong> December 15, 2025<br><strong>Related:</strong> Design Logs #58, #51, #40, #39</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Implementation Status</h2>\n' +
      '<p>✅ <strong>Completed Features:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Protocol types (<code>PluginManifest</code>, <code>Plugin</code>, <code>DynamicContractDef</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li>String-based dynamic contract generation (returns YAML, not Contract objects)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>DYNAMIC_CONTRACT_SERVICE</code> for passing contract metadata to components</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>makeContractGenerator()</code> builder API with service injection</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>@jay-framework/plugin-validator</code> package with full validation logic</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack-cli</code> refactored with <code>dev</code> and <code>validate-plugin</code> commands</li>\n' +
      '<li>Plugin scanning in <code>editor-handlers.ts</code> (local + npm packages)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Jay-html parser support for <code>plugin</code>/<code>contract</code> attributes</li>\n' +
      '<li>Page.config.yaml support for <code>plugin</code>/<code>contract</code> syntax</li>\n' +
      '<li>Shared plugin resolution in <code>@jay-framework/compiler-shared</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>NPM package resolution with <code>package.json</code> exports support</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>projectRoot</code> as explicit parameter to <code>parseJayFile</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>WithValidations</code> result monad for meaningful error messages</li>\n' +
      '<li>Yarn workspace plugin resolution using Node&#39;s <code>require.resolve()</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Direct <code>plugin.yaml</code> resolution (simpler than resolving <code>package.json</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Plugin validator enforces <code>plugin.yaml</code> export requirement (error, not warning)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Examples updated with <code>plugin.yaml</code> and new syntax</li>\n' +
      '<li>All tests passing (597 tests across all packages)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>⏳ <strong>Deferred:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Dynamic contract runtime execution (generators run at build time)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Tests for plugin validation</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Summary</h2>\n' +
      '<p>This document refines the plugin system by:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Renaming <code>app.conf.yaml</code> → <code>plugin.yaml</code> (not <code>plugin.config.yaml</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Unifying headless component reference syntax across jay-html and page.config.yaml</li>\n' +
      '<li>Adding support for dynamic contract generation (e.g., CMS-driven contracts)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Clarifying what plugin developers and jay-stack users need to do</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Key Decisions:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>✅ File name: <code>plugin.yaml</code> (shorter, follows common conventions)</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Remove <code>version</code> field (use package.json version instead)</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Remove <code>key</code> field from contract definitions (specify at usage site)</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Make <code>module</code> field optional (defaults to <code>name</code> for local plugins)</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Use package.json <code>exports</code> for NPM package path resolution</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Contract files (.jay-contract) must be published with NPM packages</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ No fallback to <code>installedApps/</code> - clean break from old structure</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Changes from Current Status</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>1. File Rename: <code>app.conf.yaml</code> → <code>plugin.yaml</code></h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Current:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">node_modules/@wix/stores/app.conf.yaml\n' +
      'src/config/installedApps/wix-stores/app.conf.yaml</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>New:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">node_modules/@wix/stores/plugin.yaml\n' +
      'src/plugins/wix-stores/plugin.yaml</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Why <code>plugin.yaml</code> not <code>plugin.config.yaml</code>?</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Shorter, cleaner</li>\n' +
      '<li>Common convention (see <code>tsconfig.json</code>, <code>package.json</code>)</li>\n' +
      '<li>&quot;config&quot; is redundant (YAML files are inherently configuration)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Migration path:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Support both names during transition</li>\n' +
      '<li>Deprecation warning for <code>app.conf.yaml</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Auto-migration tool: <code>jay migrate plugin-config</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>2. NPM Package Structure for Plugins</h3>\n' +
      '<p>An NPM plugin package should include <strong>dual builds</strong> for client-server code splitting (see Design Log #52):</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">@wix/stores/\n' +
      '├── package.json            # NPM package definition with exports\n' +
      '├── plugin.yaml             # Plugin manifest\n' +
      '├── lib/                    # Source TypeScript\n' +
      '│   ├── index.ts            # Main entry (re-exports all components)\n' +
      '│   ├── contracts/          # Contract files (.jay-contract)\n' +
      '│   │   ├── product-list.jay-contract\n' +
      '│   │   ├── product-detail.jay-contract\n' +
      '│   │   └── cart.jay-contract\n' +
      '│   └── components/\n' +
      '│       ├── product-list.ts\n' +
      '│       ├── product-detail.ts\n' +
      '│       └── cart.ts\n' +
      '├── dist/                   # Compiled JavaScript (dual builds)\n' +
      '│   ├── index.js            # Server build (client code stripped)\n' +
      '│   ├── index.client.js     # Client build (server code stripped)\n' +
      '│   └── contracts/          # Copied contract files\n' +
      '│       ├── product-list.jay-contract\n' +
      '│       ├── product-detail.jay-contract\n' +
      '│       └── cart.jay-contract\n' +
      '└── vite.config.ts          # Build configuration with dual outputs</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>package.json example:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-json"><span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;@wix/stores&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;version&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;1.0.0&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;module&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;main&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;./dist/index.js&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;exports&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;.&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;./dist/index.js&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;./client&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;./dist/index.client.js&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;./plugin.yaml&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;./plugin.yaml&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> // Required for plugin resolution\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;./contracts/*.jay-contract&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;./dist/contracts/*.jay-contract&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;files&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">&quot;dist&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">&quot;plugin.yaml&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token string">&quot;scripts&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;build&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;npm run definitions &amp;&amp; npm run build:client &amp;&amp; npm run build:server &amp;&amp; npm run build:copy-contracts&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;definitions&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;jay-cli definitions lib&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;build:client&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;vite build&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;build:server&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;vite build --ssr&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token string">&quot;build:copy-contracts&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;cp -r lib/contracts/*.jay-contract* dist/contracts/&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>vite.config.ts example:</strong></p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> resolve <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'path'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> defineConfig <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'vite'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> JayRollupConfig<span class="token punctuation">,</span> jayStackCompiler <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string"'... 193470 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Plugin System Refinement And Dynamic Contracts","number":60}'
  }
}
