{
  post: {
    title: 'RegisterReactiveGlobalContext',
    content: '<h1>registerReactiveGlobalContext</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Design Log #65 introduced <code>registerGlobalContext</code> for registering app-wide contexts during initialization via <code>makeJayInit()</code>. However, this only supports static contexts - the value is stored as-is without reactivity.</p>\n' +
      '<p>For component-provided contexts, we have:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>provideContext(marker, value)</code> - static context</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>provideReactiveContext(marker, mkContext)</code> - reactive context with signals</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>The reactive version uses <code>createReactiveContext()</code> which:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Creates a <code>Reactive</code> instance for signal tracking</li>\n' +
      '<li>Sets up <code>CONTEXT_CREATION_CONTEXT</code> so <code>createSignal()</code> works inside the factory</li>\n' +
      '<li>Returns a proxy that batches reactions for function calls</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>There&#39;s no equivalent for global contexts. When using <code>registerGlobalContext</code> in <code>withClient</code>, signals created inside the context factory won&#39;t work because there&#39;s no reactive system set up.</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// ❌ Won't work - signals have no reactive system</span>\n` +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> init <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">makeJayInit</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withClient</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>count<span class="token punctuation">,</span> setCount<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createSignal</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// Error: no reactive context</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">registerGlobalContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>COUNTER_CTX<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> count<span class="token punctuation">,</span> setCount <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Add <code>registerReactiveGlobalContext</code> to <code>@jay-framework/component</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> registerReactiveGlobalContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>T <span class="token keyword">extends</span> object<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  marker<span class="token operator">:</span> ContextMarker<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>T<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  mkContext<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> T<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> T<span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Behavior</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Creates a <code>Reactive</code> instance via <code>mkReactive(&#39;global-ctx&#39;, marker.description)</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Sets up <code>CONTEXT_CREATION_CONTEXT</code> with:<ul>\n' +
      '<li>The reactive instance</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>mountedSignal</code> initialized to <code>true</code> (always mounted)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Empty <code>provideContexts</code> (not used for global contexts)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li>Calls the factory function within this context</li>\n' +
      '<li>Wraps result in a proxy that batches reactions</li>\n' +
      '<li>Calls <code>registerGlobalContext(marker, wrappedContext)</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Returns the wrapped context (useful for accessing in the same init)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Usage</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// ✅ Works - signals have reactive system</span>\n' +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> registerReactiveGlobalContext <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/component'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> init <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">makeJayInit</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withClient</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">registerReactiveGlobalContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>COUNTER_CTX<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>count<span class="token punctuation">,</span> setCount<span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createSignal</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> count<span class="token punctuation">,</span> setCount<span class="token punctuation">,</span> increment<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">setCount</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>n<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> n <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Implementation Location</h3>\n' +
      '<p><code>@jay-framework/component/lib/context-api.ts</code> - co-located with <code>createReactiveContext</code></p>\n' +
      '<p>This makes sense because:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Already has <code>createReactiveContext</code> logic</li>\n' +
      '<li>Has access to <code>CONTEXT_CREATION_CONTEXT</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>component</code> package depends on both <code>reactive</code> and <code>runtime</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Code</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// In component/lib/context-api.ts</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> registerReactiveGlobalContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>T <span class="token keyword">extends</span> object<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>\n' +
      '  marker<span class="token operator">:</span> ContextMarker<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>T<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  mkContext<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> T<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> T <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> context <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">createReactiveContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>mkContext<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">registerGlobalContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>marker<span class="token punctuation">,</span> context<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> context<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>This is simple because <code>createReactiveContext</code> already does all the heavy lifting.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Implementation Plan</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 1: Add the function</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Add <code>registerReactiveGlobalContext</code> to <code>component/lib/context-api.ts</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Export from <code>component/lib/index.ts</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Add tests</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
