  post: {
    title: 'Jay Stack Conceptual Model',
    content: '<h1>Jay Stack Conceptual Model</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Overview</h2>\n' +
      '<p>This design log provides a conceptual diagram showing the relationships between the key building blocks of Jay Stack:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Services</strong> - Server-side singletons (database, API clients)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Contexts</strong> - Client-side hierarchical dependency injection</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Pages</strong> - Page definitions that generate website pages</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Plugins</strong> - NPM packages providing reusable contracts, components, actions</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Headless Components</strong> - Plugin-provided components with data contracts</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Init</strong> - Server and client initialization via <code>makeJayInit</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Conceptual Relationships Diagram</h2>\n' +
      '<div class="md-mermaid"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1469.3156666666666 1412.5" width="1469.3156666666666" height="1412.5">\n' +
