{
  post: {
    title: 'Route Priority Ordering For Static Vs Dynamic Routes',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #69 - Route Priority Ordering for Static vs Dynamic Routes</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The Jay Stack framework uses a file-system based routing approach where:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>src/pages/products/page.jay-html</code> → <code>/products</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><code>src/pages/products/[slug]/page.jay-html</code> → <code>/products/:slug</code> (dynamic)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>src/pages/products/ceramic-flower-vase/page.jay-html</code> → <code>/products/ceramic-flower-vase</code> (static override)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>Routes are scanned by <code>@jay-framework/stack-route-scanner</code> and registered with Express in <code>server.ts</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>When you have both a static route and a dynamic route at the same level:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">src/pages/products/\n' +
      '├── [slug]/page.jay-html              # dynamic: /products/:slug\n' +
      '├── ceramic-flower-vase/page.jay-html  # static: /products/ceramic-flower-vase\n' +
      '└── page.jay-html                      # /products</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The current <code>scanRoutes</code> function returns routes in filesystem order (whatever <code>fs.readdir</code> returns), which is not deterministic and does not consider route specificity.</p>\n' +
      '<p>Express matches routes <strong>in registration order</strong>. If <code>/products/:slug</code> is registered before <code>/products/ceramic-flower-vase</code>, the dynamic route matches first and the static route is never reached.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Expected behavior</strong>: Static routes should match before dynamic routes, allowing specific overrides.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Route Priority Rules</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Sort routes by specificity (most specific first):</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Static segments</strong> have higher priority than dynamic segments</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Single params</strong> <code>[id]</code> have higher priority than <strong>optional params</strong> <code>[[id]]</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Optional params</strong> <code>[[id]]</code> have higher priority than <strong>catch-all</strong> <code>[...id]</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>More segments</strong> have higher priority than fewer segments (at same specificity level)</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Alphabetical order</strong> as tiebreaker for determinism</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Segment Priority (lowest number = highest priority)</h3>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Segment Type</th>\n' +
      '<th>Priority</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td>Static (e.g., <code>products</code>)</td>\n' +
      '<td>0</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Single param <code>[slug]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>1</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Optional param <code>[[slug]]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>2</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td>Catch-all <code>[...path]</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>3</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<h3>Sorting Algorithm</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Compare routes segment by segment:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Compare segment at index <code>i</code> of both routes</li>\n' +
      '<li>If priorities differ, lower priority number wins</li>\n' +
      '<li>If both are static strings, compare alphabetically</li>\n' +
      '<li>If one route has more segments, continue comparing</li>\n' +
      '<li>Shorter route (with same prefix) comes after longer route</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Examples</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Given routes:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products</code> (1 static)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products/ceramic-flower-vase</code> (2 static)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products/[slug]</code> (1 static + 1 param)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products/[slug]/reviews</code> (1 static + 1 param + 1 static)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/[...path]</code> (1 catch-all)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Sorted order:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products/ceramic-flower-vase</code> ← 2 static segments</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products/[slug]/reviews</code> ← more specific (has trailing static)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products/[slug]</code> ← 1 static + 1 param</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/products</code> ← 1 static segment</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>/[...path]</code> ← catch-all (lowest priority)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Implementation Plan</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 1: Add sorting function to route-scanner</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>File</strong>: <code>jay/packages/jay-stack/route-scanner/lib/route-scanner.ts</code></p>\n' +
      '<p>Add a <code>sortRoutesByPriority</code> function and apply it in <code>scanRoutes</code>.</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">getSegmentPriority</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>segment<span class="token operator">:</span> JayRouteSegment<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> number <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `  <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">typeof</span> segment <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token string">'string'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// Static</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token function">switch </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>segment<span class="token punctuation">.</span>type<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">case</span> JayRouteParamType<span class="token punctuation">.</span>single<span class="token operator">:</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">case</span> JayRouteParamType<span class="token punctuation">.</span>optional<span class="token operator">:</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">2</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">case</span> JayRouteParamType<span class="token punctuation">.</span>catchAll<span class="token operator">:</span>\n' +
      '      <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">3</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">compareRoutes</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>a<span class="token operator">:</span> JayRoute<span class="token punctuation">,</span> b<span class="token operator">:</span> JayRoute<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> number <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">const</span> maxLen <span class="token operator">=</span> Math<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">max</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>a<span class="token punctuation">.</span>segments<span class="token punctuation">.</span>length<span class="token punctuation">,</span> b<span class="token punctuation">.</span>segments<span class="token punctuation">.</span>length<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">for </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">let</span> i <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> i <span class="token operator">&lt;</span> maxLen<span class="token punctuation">;</span> i<span class="token operator">++</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> segA <span class="token operator">=</span> a<span class="token punctuation">.</span>segments<span class="token punctuation">[</span>i<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> segB <span class="token operator">=</span> b<span class="token punctuation">.</span>segments<span class="token punctuation">[</span>i<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      `    <span class="token comment">// If one route is shorter, it's less specific (comes later)</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>segA <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token keyword">undefined</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>segB <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token keyword">undefined</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token operator">-</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> priorityA <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">getSegmentPriority</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>segA<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
