{
  post: {
    title: 'Skip Client Script For Non-Interactive Components',
    content: '<h1>Skip Client Script for Non-Interactive Components</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>From Design Logs #49, #52, and #55, Jay Stack components have three rendering phases:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Slow</strong>: Build-time or data-change-time rendering</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Fast</strong>: Request-time rendering</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Interactive</strong>: Client-side interactivity</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>A full stack component may not have an interactive phase at all - it could be purely server-rendered with only slow and/or fast phases.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>When a full stack component doesn&#39;t define <code>.withInteractive()</code>:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>The <code>comp</code> property on <code>JayStackComponentDefinition</code> remains <code>undefined</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>In <code>load-page-parts.ts</code>, we always generate <code>clientPart</code> referencing <code>page.comp</code>:<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">clientPart<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">`{comp: page.comp, contextMarkers: page.contexts || []}`</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li>The client script is generated with this part</li>\n' +
      '<li>In <code>composite-component.ts</code> line 62, we call <code>part.comp(props, partRefs, ...partContexts)</code></li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>CRASH</strong>: <code>TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined</code></li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Example of a component without interactive phase:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> page <span class="token operator">=</span> makeJayStackComponent<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageContract<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span>withProps<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>PageProps<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withServices</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>DATABASE_SERVICE<span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withSlowlyRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">async </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> db<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">const</span> data <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">await</span> db<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">query</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token function">partialRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> data <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">withFastRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token function">async </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>props<span class="token punctuation">,</span> slowCF<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token function">partialRender</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> timestamp<span class="token operator">:</span> Date<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">now</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// No .withInteractive() - purely server-rendered!</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Analysis</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Current Flow</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">load-page-parts.ts\n' +
      '    │\n' +
      '    ├── Load page component\n' +
      '    │   pageComponent = (await vite.ssrLoadModule(route.compPath)).page\n' +
      '    │\n' +
      '    └── Always add to parts (even if comp is undefined)\n' +
      '        parts.push({\n' +
      '            compDefinition: pageComponent,\n' +
      "            clientImport: `import {page} from '${route.compPath}'`,\n" +
      '            clientPart: `{comp: page.comp, ...}`  // ❌ page.comp may be undefined!\n' +
      '        })\n' +
      '            │\n' +
      '            ▼\n' +
      'generate-client-script.ts\n' +
      '    │\n' +
      '    ├── Generate client script with ALL parts\n' +
      '    │   makeCompositeJayComponent(render, viewState, fastCF, parts)\n' +
      '    │\n' +
      '            │\n' +
      '            ▼\n' +
      'composite-component.ts (browser)\n' +
      '    │\n' +
      '    └── Call part.comp(...) for each part\n' +
      '        part.comp(props, partRefs, ...partContexts)  // ❌ CRASH if undefined!</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Where to Fix</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Option A: Filter in <code>load-page-parts.ts</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Don&#39;t add parts without <code>comp</code> to the parts array</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Early filtering, clean data</li>\n' +
      '<li>⚠️ Still generates client script even if no interactive parts</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Option B: Filter in <code>generate-client-script.ts</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Filter parts before generating script</li>\n' +
      '<li>Skip script generation entirely if no parts have interactive components</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Avoids unnecessary client-side JavaScript</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Option C: Handle in <code>composite-component.ts</code></strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Filter out parts where <code>comp</code> is undefined</li>\n' +
      '<li>✅ Most defensive, handles all edge cases</li>\n' +
      '<li>⚠️ Client still loads parts that do nothing</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Recommended: Combination of A + B</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>In <code>load-page-parts.ts</code>: Only add parts with <code>comp</code> defined</li>\n' +
      '<li>In <code>generate-client-script.ts</code>: Check if parts array is empty and handle appropriately</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Changes to <code>load-page-parts.ts</code></h3>\n' +
      '<p>Only add page/headless components to client parts if they have an interactive component:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// For page component</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> pageComponent <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">await</span> vite<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">ssrLoadModule</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>route<span class="token punctuation">.</span>compPath<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>page<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// Always add to parts for server-side rendering</span>\n' +
      'parts<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">push</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  compDefinition<span class="token operator">:</span> pageComponent<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">// Only include client import/part if interactive phase exists</span>\n' +
      '  clientImport<span class="token operator">:</span> pageComponent<span class="token punctuation">.</span>comp <span class="token operator">?</span> <span class="token string">`import {page} from \'${route.compPath}\'`</span> <span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token keyword">undefined</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  clientPart<span class="token operator">:</span> pageComponent<span class="token punctuation">.</span>comp\n' +
      '    <span class="token operator">?</span> <span class="token string">`{comp: page.comp, contextMarkers: page.contexts || []}`</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token keyword">undefined</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Wait - looking at the current structure, <code>DevServerPagePart</code> has both server-side (<code>compDefinition</code>) and client-side (<code>clientImport</code>, <code>clientPart</code>) concerns. Let&#39;s trace how these are used.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Analyzing Current Usage</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Server-side uses:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>compDefinition.services</code> - for service resolution</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>compDefinition.loadParams</code> - for URL parameter loading</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>compDefinition.slowlyRender</code> - for slow phase rendering</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>compDefinition.fastRender</code> - for fast phase rendering</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Client-side uses:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>clientImport</code> - import statement in client script</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>clientPart</code> - part object in client script</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>The issue is that <code>parts</code> is used for BOTH server-side rendering AND client script generation. A component without interactive phase still needs to be in <code>parts</code> for server-side rendering, but should NOT have <code>clientImport'... 16527 more characters,
