{
  post: {
    title: 'Automation Dev Server Integration',
    content: '<h1>Automation Dev Server Integration</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Design Log #76 introduced <code>@jay-framework/runtime-automation</code> for programmatic UI interaction. The package provides:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>wrapWithAutomation(component)</code> - wraps a component with automation API</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>getPageState()</code> - get current ViewState and interactions</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>triggerEvent(eventType, coordinate)</code> - trigger events on elements</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>onStateChange(callback)</code> - subscribe to state changes</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>Currently, automation must be manually integrated by importing and wrapping components.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>No automatic dev server integration</strong> - Developers must manually add automation to use it in dev mode</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>No standard way for plugins to access automation</strong> - Plugins like testing tools, accessibility checkers, or AI assistants cannot easily access the automation API</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Questions and Answers</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Q1: Should automation always load in dev server?</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, in dev mode. Automation adds minimal overhead and is useful for:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Browser console debugging</li>\n' +
      '<li>Plugin integrations (testing, accessibility, AI)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Developer tooling</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>In production builds, it should be optional/tree-shakeable.</p>\n' +
      '<h3>Q2: How should plugins access the automation API?</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Via a global context. This follows the existing pattern:</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> useContext <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> AUTOMATION_CONTEXT <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/runtime-automation'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// In plugin or component</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> automation <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">useContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>AUTOMATION_CONTEXT<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'automation<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getPageState</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Q3: Should the automation be exposed on <code>window</code> for console access?</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, for dev mode convenience:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-javascript"><span class="token comment">// Browser console</span>\n' +
      'window<span class="token punctuation">.</span>__jay<span class="token punctuation">.</span>automation<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getPageState</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      `window<span class="token punctuation">.</span>__jay<span class="token punctuation">.</span>automation<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">triggerEvent</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'click'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">'addBtn'</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n` +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>1. Export Context from runtime-automation</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// lib/automation-context.ts</span>\n' +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> createJayContext <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> type <span class="token punctuation">{</span> AutomationAPI <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'./types'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">const</span> AUTOMATION_CONTEXT <span class="token operator">=</span> createJayContext<span class="token operator">&lt;</span>AutomationAPI<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>2. Dev Server Integration</h3>\n' +
      '<p>The dev server already generates client scripts via <code>generateClientScript</code>. We add automation initialization:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// In generated client script</span>\n' +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> wrapWithAutomation<span class="token punctuation">,</span> AUTOMATION_CONTEXT <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/runtime-automation'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> registerGlobalContext <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/runtime'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// After component creation</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> instance <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">pageComp</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>viewState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>fastCarryForward <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> wrapped <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token function">wrapWithAutomation</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>instance<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// Register as global context for plugins</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">registerGlobalContext</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>AUTOMATION_CONTEXT<span class="token punctuation">,</span> wrapped<span class="token punctuation">.</span>automation<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// Expose on window for console access</span>\n' +
      'window<span class="token punctuation">.</span>__jay <span class="token operator">=</span> window<span class="token punctuation">.</span>__jay <span class="token operator">||</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      'window<span class="token punctuation">.</span>__jay<span class="token punctuation">.</span>automation <span class="token operator">=</span> wrapped<span class="token punctuation">.</span>automation<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      'target<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">appendChild</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>wrapped<span class="token punctuation">.</span>element<span class="token punctuation">.</span>dom<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>3. Option to Disable</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Add option in dev server config:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript">interface DevServerOptions <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">// ... existing</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">/** Disable automation integration (default: false in dev) */</span>\n' +
      '  disableAutomation<span class="token operator">?:</span> boolean<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>4. Stack Client Runtime Export</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Export a helper from <code>@jay-framework/stack-client-runtime</code> for consistency:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// In stack-client-runtime</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  wrapWithAutomation<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  AUTOMATION_CONTEXT<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  type AutomationAPI<span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      `<span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/runtime-automation'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></code></pre>\n` +
      '<h2>Data Flow</h2>\n' +
      '<div class="md-mermaid"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 554.5229999999999 926.4000000000001" width="554.5229999999999" height="926.4000000000001">\n' +
      '<style>\n' +
      '  svg {\n' +
