{
  post: {
    title: 'Dev Server Test Mode',
    content: '<h1>Design Log #81: Dev Server Test Mode</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>When running smoke tests or integration tests against the dev server, we need reliable ways to:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Know when the server is ready to accept requests</li>\n' +
      '<li>Cleanly shut down the server after tests complete</li>\n' +
      '<li>Optionally auto-terminate after a timeout (for CI safety)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p>Currently, tests must:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Spawn the dev server as a child process</li>\n' +
      '<li>Parse stdout for &quot;Jay Stack dev server started successfully&quot;</li>\n' +
      '<li>Kill the process when done (via SIGTERM)</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<p>This is fragile - port detection requires regex parsing, and process cleanup can leave orphaned Vite workers.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Readiness detection</strong>: No standard way to know server is ready</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Cleanup</strong>: Process.kill() doesn&#39;t always clean up child processes</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>CI safety</strong>: Long-running server can hang CI if tests fail</li>\n' +
      '<li><strong>Port detection</strong>: Server port is dynamic, requires parsing output</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Questions and Answers</h2>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Q1: Should this be a separate CLI command or flags on <code>dev</code>?</strong>\n' +
      'A1: Flags on <code>dev</code> - keeps it simple, <code>--test-mode</code> enables test features.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Q2: Should shutdown require authentication?</strong>\n' +
      'A2: No - test mode is explicitly opt-in. In production builds, these endpoints won&#39;t exist.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Q3: Should we use a dedicated test port range?</strong>\n' +
      'A3: No - keep dynamic port allocation, but make it easier to detect.</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>CLI Flags</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token comment"># Enable test mode (health + shutdown endpoints)</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">jay-stack-cli</span> <span class="token function">dev</span> --<span class="token function">test-mode</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment"># Auto-shutdown after N seconds (implies --test-mode)</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">jay-stack-cli</span> <span class="token function">dev</span> --<span class="token function">timeout</span> 60\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment"># Combined</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">jay-stack-cli</span> <span class="token function">dev</span> --<span class="token function">test-mode</span> --<span class="token function">timeout</span> 30</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>Endpoints (only when --test-mode is enabled)</h3>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>Endpoint</th>\n' +
      '<th>Method</th>\n' +
      '<th>Response</th>\n' +
      '<th>Purpose</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</thead>\n' +
      '<tbody><tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/_jay/health</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>GET</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>{&quot;status&quot;:&quot;ready&quot;,&quot;port&quot;:3300}</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Readiness check</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<td><code>/_jay/shutdown</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>POST</td>\n' +
      '<td><code>{&quot;status&quot;:&quot;shutting_down&quot;}</code></td>\n' +
      '<td>Graceful shutdown</td>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
      '</tbody></table>\n' +
      '<h3>Startup Output Enhancement</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">🚀 Jay Stack dev server started successfully!\n' +
      '📱 Dev Server: http://localhost:3300\n' +
      '🎨 Editor Server: http://localhost:3301\n' +
      '📁 Pages directory: ./src/pages\n' +
      '🧪 Test Mode: enabled\n' +
      '   Health: http://localhost:3300/_jay/health\n' +
      '   Shutdown: curl -X POST http://localhost:3300/_jay/shutdown\n' +
      '   Timeout: 60s</code></pre>\n' +
      '<h3>JSON Output Mode (for programmatic use)</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">jay-stack-cli</span> <span class="token function">dev</span> --<span class="token function">test-mode</span> --json</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>Outputs on ready:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-json"><span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token string">&quot;event&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;ready&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">&quot;devServer&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;http://localhost:3300&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">&quot;editorServer&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;http://localhost:3301&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<h2>Implementation Plan</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 1: Core Test Mode</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Add <code>--test-mode</code> and <code>--timeout</code> flags to CLI</li>\n' +
      '<li>Add <code>/_jay/health</code> endpoint returning <code>{status: &quot;ready&quot;, port: number}</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Add <code>/_jay/shutdown</code> endpoint that calls graceful shutdown</li>\n' +
      '<li>Update startup output to show test mode info</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 2: Enhanced Smoke Tests</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Update fake-shop smoke test to use health endpoint for readiness</li>\n' +
      '<li>Use shutdown endpoint for cleanup instead of process.kill()</li>\n' +
      '<li>Add timeout flag for CI safety</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 3: Optional Enhancements</h3>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>JSON output mode for programmatic parsing</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>--port</code> flag to request specific port (fail if unavailable)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Code Changes</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>CLI (jay-stack-cli)</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// commands/dev.ts</span>\n' +
      `<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">option</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'--test-mode'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'Enable test endpoints (/_jay/health, /_jay/shutdown)'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">option</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'--timeout &lt;seconds&gt;'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'Auto-shutdown after N seconds (implies --test-mode)'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> parseInt<span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre>\n` +
      '<h3>Dev Server</h3>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token comment">// dev-server.ts</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>options<span class="token punctuation">.</span>testMode<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `  app<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">get</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'/_jay/health'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>req<span class="token punctuation">,</span> res<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n` +
      `    res<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">json</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> status<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'ready'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> port<span class="token operator">:</span> options<span class="token punctuation">.</span>port <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      `  app<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">post</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'/_jay/shutdown'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token function">async </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>req<span class="token punctuation">,</span> res<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n` +
      `    res<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">json</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span> status<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">'shutting_down'</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '    <span class="token keyword">await</span> <span class="token function">gracefulShutdown</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    process<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">exit</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token function">if </span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>options<span class="token punctuation">.</span>timeout<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token function">setTimeout</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">`[DevServer] Timeout (${options.timeout}s) reached, shutting down`</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '    <span class="token function">gracefulShutdown</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token functio'... 12622 more characters,
