{
  post: {
    title: 'Dev Server Logging And Timing',
    content: '<h1>Design Log 83: Dev Server Logging and Timing</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>The jay-stack-cli <code>dev</code> command outputs verbose logging during transformations, making it hard to see important information. Developers need:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li>Clean output by default (keep startup messages)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Verbose mode for debugging</li>\n' +
      '<li>Performance timing for key operations</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Current dev server output includes many transformation logs that clutter the console. There&#39;s no way to:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Suppress verbose logging while keeping important startup info</li>\n' +
      '<li>Enable detailed logging when needed</li>\n' +
      '<li>See timing metrics for SSR, load params, slow/fast rendering, and Vite compilation</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Design</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>1. CLI Flags</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Add flags to <code>dev</code> command in <code>stack-cli/lib/cli.ts</code>:</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">option</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'-v, --verbose'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'Enable verbose logging output'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>\n` +
      `<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">option</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'-q, --quiet'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'Suppress all non-error output'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre>\n` +
      '<h3>2. New Logger Package</h3>\n' +
      '<p>Create a new package <code>@jay-framework/logger</code> that all compiler/runtime packages can depend on.</p>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Package structure:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="">packages/jay-stack/logger/\n' +
      '├── lib/\n' +
      '│   └── index.ts\n' +
      '├── package.json\n' +
      '└── tsconfig.json</code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>In <code>logger/lib/index.ts</code>:</strong></p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">export</span> type LogLevel <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token string">'silent'</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token string">'info'</span> <span class="token operator">|</span> <span class="token string">'verbose'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> interface JayLogger <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">/** Log important messages - shown in default mode (startup, major events) */</span>\n' +
      '  important<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">/** Log info messages - shown only in verbose mode */</span>\n' +
      '  info<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">/** Log warnings - shown unless silent */</span>\n' +
      '  warn<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token comment">/** Log errors - always shown */</span>\n' +
      '  error<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token operator">:</span> string<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// Default implementation using console</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">const</span> defaultLogger<span class="token operator">:</span> JayLogger <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  important<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  info<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  warn<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">warn</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '  error<span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">error</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">let</span> currentLogger<span class="token operator">:</span> JayLogger <span class="token operator">=</span> defaultLogger<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">getLogger</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> JayLogger <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> currentLogger<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">setLogger</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>logger<span class="token operator">:</span> JayLogger<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  currentLogger <span class="token operator">=</span> logger<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">export</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">resetLogger</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '  currentLogger <span class="token operator">=</span> defaultLogger<span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">}</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>In <code>stack-cli/lib/server.ts</code>:</strong> Replace the logger at startup with a level-aware implementation:</p>\n' +
      `<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="token keyword">import</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> setLogger <span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">from</span> <span class="token string">'@jay-framework/logger'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">// Create level-aware logger</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token function">createCliLogger</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>level<span class="token operator">:</span> LogLevel<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token operator">:</span> JayLogger <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      `  <span class="token keyword">const</span> isQuiet <span class="token operator">=</span> level <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token string">'silent'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      `  <span class="token keyword">const</span> isVerbose <span class="token operator">=</span> level <span class="token operator">===</span> <span class="token string">'verbose'</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>\n` +
      '\n' +
      '  <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>\n' +
      '    important<span class="token operator">:</span> isQuiet <span class="token operator">?</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span><span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>\n' +
      '    info<span class="token operator">:</span> isVerbose <span class="token operator">?</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span cla'... 15474 more characters,
    description: '',
    date: '',
    tags: [],
    frontmatter: '{"title":"Dev Server Logging And Timing","number":83}'
  }
}
