{
  post: {
    title: 'Headless Component Props And Repeater Support',
    content: '<h1>Headless Component Props and Repeater Support</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Date:</strong> February 4, 2026<br><strong>Status:</strong> Draft<br><strong>Related:</strong> Design Logs #50, #58, #60, #80</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Background</h2>\n' +
      '<p>Jay Stack supports headless components from plugins that provide data contracts for page rendering. Currently, headless components are imported once per page via <code>&lt;script type=&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;&gt;</code> tags:</p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">plugin</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;wix-stores&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;product-list&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">key</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;products&quot;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>The component renders once per page, with its data bound to the <code>key</code> attribute (e.g., <code>{products.items}</code>).</p>\n' +
      '<h2>Problem Statement</h2>\n' +
      '<p>We need to support scenarios where the same headless component is used multiple times on a page with <strong>different configuration/props</strong>:</p>\n' +
      '<ol>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Multiple instances with different IDs</strong>: A page showing 3 product cards for featured products, each with a different <code>productId</code></p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Repeater/forEach usage</strong>: A product grid where each cell is a product card component bound to an item from a list</p>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '<li><p><strong>Static vs dynamic props</strong>: Props that are:</p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Static (known at build time): <code>productId=&quot;prod-123&quot;</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>Dynamic from page data: <code>productId={featuredProducts[0]._id}</code></li>\n' +
      '<li>From repeater context: <code>productId={_id}</code> inside a <code>forEach</code></li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<h3>Example Scenarios</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Scenario A: Multiple featured products</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token comment">&lt;!-- Current: Cannot do this --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;featured&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;product-card</span> <span class="token attribute">productId</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;prod-123&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;product-card</span> <span class="token attribute">productId</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;prod-456&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;product-card</span> <span class="token attribute">productId</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;prod-789&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Scenario B: Product grid with repeater</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token comment">&lt;!-- Current: Cannot do this --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="token attribute">class</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;product-grid&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">forEach</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;products.items&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">trackBy</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;_id&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token tag">&lt;product-card</span> <span class="token attribute">productId</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;{_id}&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Scenario C: Agent discovering available product IDs</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li>Agent needs to know valid <code>productId</code> values to generate meaningful pages</li>\n' +
      '<li>Plugin should expose discoverable data sources</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h2>Questions and Answers</h2>\n' +
      '<h3>Q1: How should props be passed to headless component instances?</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>Options:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<p>A) <strong>Extended script tag with props attribute</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">plugin</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;wix-stores&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;product-card&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">key</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;featured1&quot;</span>\n' +
      `  <span class="token attribute">props</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">'{&quot;productId&quot;: &quot;prod-123&quot;}'</span>\n` +
      '<span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>B) <strong>Web component style with custom element</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;wix-stores-product-card</span> <span class="token attribute">productId</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;prod-123&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">key</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;featured1&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>C) <strong>Named instances with inline props</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">plugin</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;wix-stores&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;product-card&quot;</span>\n' +
      '  <span class="token attribute">key</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;featured&quot;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
      '\n' +
      '<span class="token comment">&lt;!-- Later in template --&gt;</span>\n' +
      '<span class="token tag">&lt;jay-headless</span> <span class="token attribute">use</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;featured&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">productId</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;prod-123&quot;</span> <span class="token punctuation">/</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n' +
      '<p>D) <strong>Import once, instantiate with data binding</strong></p>\n' +
      '<pre class="md-code"><code class="language-html"><span class="token tag">&lt;script</span> <span class="token attribute">type</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;application/jay-headless&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">plugin</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;wix-stores&quot;</span> <span class="token attribute">contract</span><span class="token punctuation">=</span><span class="token string">&quot;product-card&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span><span class="token tag">&lt;/script</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span>\n' +
