      '<li>For each page: resolve slow props (static values, load params)</li>\n' +
      '<li>Call component&#39;s <code>slowlyRender(props)</code> → slow ViewState + carryForward</li>\n' +
      '<li>Transform jay-html template with slow ViewState</li>\n' +
      '<li>Store rendered HTML + carryForward for fast phase</li>\n' +
      '<li>Cache results (page-level caching, includes nested component slow renders)</li>\n' +
      '</ol>\n' +
      '<p><strong>CLI:</strong></p>\n' +
      '<ul>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack dev</code> - dev server (includes slow render)</li>\n' +
      '<li><code>jay-stack build</code> (future) - production build</li>\n' +
      '</ul>\n' +
      '<h3>Phase 6: Fast Render (SSR / Request Time)</h3>\n' +
      '<p><strong>What happens:</strong> Per-request rendering. Session-aware, dynamic data injected.</p>\n' +
