{
  post: {
    title: 'Index',
    content: '<h1>Jay Design Log Index</h1>\n' +
      '<blockquote>\n' +
      '<p><em>Written for AI agents. See <a href="#log-methodology-note">Log Methodology Note</a> below for details.</em></p>\n' +
      '</blockquote>\n' +
      '<p>Quick reference to find relevant design logs by topic. Design logs capture design decisions as they happen and are not updated after implementation.</p>\n' +
      '<hr>\n' +
      '<h2>Core Concepts &amp; Architecture</h2>\n' +
      '<table>\n' +
      '<thead>\n' +
      '<tr>\n' +
      '<th>#</th>\n' +
      '<th>Title</th>\n' +
      '<th>Description</th>\n' +
      '</tr>\n' +
